<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yosh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOSHUWA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Yoshuwa mwendelezu gwa Histoliya ya isi ya Israeli pa maholu ga Lagiru kupera, wantu wa Israeli wanjiti mwanja uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Yoridani, shitabu sha Yoshuwa shitakulira ntambu gaa wapititi mumbeku mwa lushemba Yoridani na kusoka mulitapaka lya kanani pawalonguziwa na Yoshuwa yakamhaliti Musa. Katenda hangu toziya Mlungu kamlagaliriti Musa. Amu Mlungu kafaniziyiti shakalongiti shakuwapanana litapaka kanani ya wiwuka Ibrahimu (Lyanjiru 12:7). Imanika ndiri handa kalembiti shitabu sha Yoshuwa shaka ashi mlemba kulonga handa kwaniti malawiru gavuwa gakola lupenu (kwa mfanu Yoshuwa 5:1-6) Toziya ayi wana wavuwa wakushuli wajimira kuwera Yoshuwa kalembati vintola viwuwa mweni, hangu twana nakaka kwahera yumonga kalembiti vitabu avi gambira Yoshuwa kulemba nakala, handa shiwembu na kufindira. Yoshuwa 24: 29 wafundwa wamonga wajimira handa shitabu ashi shilembitwi mushinja sha 800 pa lilawiru kulawira. Lilawiru lya shintola sha Yoshuwa shilawiriti mushaka sha 1250 B.C. Sheni shitoliti mivinja 40 pa Rameki kulonguziya Mumisri Rameki kaweriti mfalumi mweni kaweriti kawalonguziya shaka Waisraeli pawaweriti wankulawa Misri (Kulawa 1:11)</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 5:12 Shitakulira wana wa Israeli walokiti lushemba Yoridani na kwingira mpaka mulitapaka lya Kanani.</para>
  <para style="io">Viraa shipandi sha 5:13 mpaka 12 shitakulira Waisraeli wasoka Kanani.</para>
  <para style="io">Shimonga shipandi sha 13 mpaka 12 shitakulira ntambu gaa lipatanu lya Kanani libagulika muwamu mwa likabila lya israeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Upeleru shipandi sha 22 mpaka 24 shitakulira ntambu gaa muwamu mwa likabila lya Israeli liweriti kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Yoridani, Visoweru vyakuyi vya upeleru vya Joshuwa kwa Isi, kuhowa na kufindirwa kwakuyi pamuhera na wana wa Israeli ntambu yawanemeleriti maholu ga lipatanu lyawu na Mlungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kawera mlonguziya gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Pakahowiti kala Musa, ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, ntumintumi gwa Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />Ntumintumi gwangu Musa kahowa, vinu mloki lushemba Yoridani, gwenga pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri mpaka kuisi irii yanuwapanani. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kila isi yanamtimbi niwapanani ntambu yanumlagiliti Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Mbaka ya isi yenu hayiweri hangu. Kusika ndo shiwala, kushana ndo migongu ya Lebanoni, Lebanoni, kwagulawa mshenji ndo lushemba lulii lukulu Eufirati, kupitira isi yoseri ya Wahiti mpaka bahari ya Mediteraniya uwega wa kwaguzyetera mshenji. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Kwahera muntu yoseri yanakakukanki mashaka goseri ga makaliru gaku. Neni haweri pamuhera na gwenga ntambu yanuweriti pamuhera na Musa. Mashaka goseri haweri pamuhera na gwenga hapeni nikuleki gwenga nakamu. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Guweri mkamalira na mgangamala toziya gwenga haguwalongoziyi wantu awa kuhala isi irii yaniwalapiriti wazewi wawu kuwera haniwapanani. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Guweri mkamalira na mgangamala, guliloleri weri kugatenda Malagaliru goseri gakakugambiliti ntumintumi gwangu Musa. Gufati kila semu ya lagaliru ali na gwenga hagufanikiwi kwoseri kwagugenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Naguleka nakamu shintola ashi sha lagaliru kushibetula mukuguwira kwaku. Su guliholi pashiru na paluwala na guvijimila vitwatira vyoseri vyavilembuwa amu. Shakapanu gwenga hagugendi weri. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Guliholi kuwera neni nukulagalira guweri mkamalira na mgangamala. Nagutira ama kutwezuka toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku, napamuhera na gwenga kwoseri kwagugenda.<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuwalagalira wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawalagalira walongoziya wa wantu. <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />Mgendi mulugonjeru lyoseri na kuwagambira wantu watandi shiboga, “Toziya pa mashaka matatu hamloki lushemba lwa Yoridani, kugenda kuikolamlima isi yeni Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawapanana iweri ya mwenga.”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Yoshuwa kawagambira wantu wa likabira lya Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabira lya Manasi. <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Muliholi malagaliru galii Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagaliriti pakalonga, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakakupanani pahala pa kwoyera na hakawapanani isi ayi.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Wadala wenu na wananguta wenu na wankanyama wenu wa kulolera hawasigali muisi irii Musa kawapananiti, uwega awu wa lushemba Yoridani. Kumbiti wapalu woseri wagangamala pawawera na vintu vya kulikomangira hawaloki lushemba na kuwalongolera walongu wenu. <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />Hamuwatangi mpaka Mtuwa Mlungu pakawapanana walongu wenu viraa pahala pa kwoyera, ntambu yakawapananiti mwenga. Na womberi viraa iweri yawu isi irii yawapananuwa na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Shakapanu hamuwuyi muisi irii yaiwera lunda yenu na iweri yenu isi irii yampananituwi na Musa, ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, uwega kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Womberi wamwankula Yoshuwa, “Vitwatira vyoseri vyagutugambiriti hatuvitendi na kwoseri pagulagalira hatugendi. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Hatukujimili gwenga ntambu yatumjimiliti Musa muvisoweru vyoseri, Mtuwa Mlungu kaweri na gwenga ntambu yakaweriti na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Muntu yoseri yakalema amuli yaku ama kujimira ndiri visoweru vyaku ama shitwatila shoseri shagumgambiziya, hakalagwi. Kumbiti gwenga guweri mkamalira na kuwera mgangamala.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuwatuma walolalola Yeriku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />“Shakapanu Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nuni, kawatumiti wantu wawili kwa bada kulawa Shitimu, wagendi wakaloliloli muisi ilii asa mlushi lwa Yeriku. Wagenda,” wasoka kunumba ya mndiyandiya yumu yawamshema Rahabu wagonja aku. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Mfalumi gwa Yeriku kagambiluwa, “Guloli, wapalu wawili Waisraeli wingira mjini leru pashiru su kuilolalola isi.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Su kalagaliriti milagilagi kwa Rahabu wamgambiri, “Guwalaviyi kunja wantu yawawera mnumba mwaku yawiza kuilolalola isi.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Kumbiti mdala ulii kaweriti kawafifa kala wantu wawili awa. Su kawagambira walagilagi awa, “Ndo nakaka handa wantu awa wiziti kwaneni, kumbiti neni nivimana ndiri kwawalawiti. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Womberi wawukiti mshenji paguzyetiti pamberi pa ligomi likulu lya lushi kutatuwa. Neni nivimana ndiri kulii kwawagenditi, su muwafati kalongola hamuwabati.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Kumbiti Rahabu kawakweniziyiti walolalola walii kulitala na kuwafifa kwa miweregi ga nguwu nfufu gakagayalikiti aku. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Su wantu yawalagalirituwiti na mfalumi wawafatiti kwa kupitira njira yaigenditi kuviloku vya Yoridani. Na katepu hera pawawukiti kumjini, ligomi likulu lya mji litatuwa.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Pamberi walolalola walii hawenigonji, Rahabu kawagendiriti kulitala kuliii, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />kawagambira, “Nivimana kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanana isi ayi. Kila muntu muisi ayi kawera na lyoga kuusu mwenga na wenikaya woseri wa isi ayi wahera makakala toziya ya mwenga. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Twenga tupikaniriti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakagayumiziyiti mashi ga bahari ya Shamu kulongolu kwenu pamlawiti muisi ya Misri. Na ntambu yamuwatenderiti wafalumi wawili wa Waamori yawaweriti kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani, Sihoni na Ogu, weni muwalagiti nakamu. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Palaa patupikaniriti visoweru avi, tuweriti na lyoga nentu toziya ya mwenga. Tupeluwa makakala nakamu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ndo Mlungu gwa kumpindi na pasipanu. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Vinu munapiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kuwera hamuntenderi maheri neni pamuhera na kaya yangu ntambu yanuwatenderiti maheri, su munanguziyi lilangaliru lya ujimira. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Munagili neni kuwera mwenga hamumulagi ndiri tati gwangu na mawu gwangu na wakaka wangu na wadada wangu pamuhera na kaya zawu zoseri. Hapeni mwenga mtuleki twilaguwi!”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Wantu walii wamgambira, “Ukomu wenu ndo ukomu wa twenga! Mlungu na katulagi handa twenga patutenda ndiri ntambu yatutakula! Handa pamumgambira ndiri muntu yoseri visoweru vyatutenda, twenga tukulagila gwenga kuwera Mlungu pakatupanana isi ayi, hatukutenderi gwenga uheri.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Su Rahabu kawasulusiya wantu walii kwa lugoyi kupitira mulidirisha, toziya numba yakuwi iweriti inyawiwa mushibambaza sha mji gwa Yeriku. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Kawagambira, “Mgendi mumigongu mkalififi aku su yawawasakula nawawawona. Mlikali aku kwa mashaka matatu, mpaka yawawafata pawawuya kumjini, shakapanu mgendi zenu.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Wantu walii wamgambira mdala ulii, “Twenga hatushitendi nakamu shitwitira shagututenditi tulagila kwa kulirapa. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Patusoka muisi ayi, gutawi lugoyi lusheri alu mulidirisha lilii lyagutusulusiliriti pasi. Guwatuli pamuhera tati gwaku na mawu gwaku, walongu waku na kaya ya tati gwaku yoseri mnumba mwaku. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Handa muntu yoseri pakalawa kunja ya numba yaku na kugenda kunumba yimonga, hapeni tuweri na ndawumu kulawirana na kuhowa kwakuwi. Kumbiti handa muntu yoseri pakawera mkati mwa mnumba yaku pakashinkuluwa hera, su shitwatira sha kuhowa kwakuwi hashiweri kwa twenga. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Kumbiti handa pagumgambira muntu yoseri kuusu visoweru vyetu, su twenga hapeni tufati lirapu lyatukulapiriti gwenga.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Yomberi kawagambira “Na iweri ntambu yamlongiti.” Shakapanu kawajimira wagendi zawu, nawomberi wawuka. Nayomberi kalutawa lugoyi lulii lusheri mulidilisha.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Walolalola walii wagenditi kumigongu. Walikaliti aku kwa mashaka matatu mpaka walii yawaweriti wankuwasakula pawawuyiti Yeriku pota kuwawona. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Su walolalola wawili awa waselera kulawa kumigongu, walokiti lushemba na kumgendera Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nuni, wamgambira vyoseri vyawapatiti. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />“Nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu kayitula isi yoseri mumawoku mwetu. Kayi wenikaya wa isi ayi watwezuka twezu toziya ya twenga.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankuloka lushemba Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Mandawira putiputi Yoshuwa pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli wanjiti mwanja kulawa Shitimu. Pawasokiti kulushemba Yoridani, wagonjiriti panu kwa shipindi pamberi pa kuloka. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Pa mashaka matatu walongoziya wapititi pakati pa lugonjeru alu, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />na kuwagambira wantu, “Pamuwawona watambika wa likabila lya Walawi wapapa lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hamuwuki na kulifata. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Ndo hamuvimani njira ya kupita toziya hamweni piti aku nakamu. Kumbiti namulisegelera nentu lisanduku lya lipatanu, muweri utali handa kilomita yimu.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yoshuwa kawagambiriti wantu, “Mulipungi maweni, toziya shirawu Mtuwa Mlungu hakatendi mauzauza pakati pa mwenga.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawagambiriti watambika, “Mtoli lisanduku lya lipatanu, mlongoleri nali kulongolu kwa wantu.” Womberi walitoliti na kulongolera kulongolu kwa wantu.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, “Leru panu, hananji kukukwisa kulongolu kwa wantu woseri wa Israeli su wavimani kuwera, ntambu yaweriti pamuhera na Musa, ndo viraa haweri pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Guwagambiri watambika awa yawapapa lisanduku lya lipatanu pawasoka mulushema Yoridani, wagendi wagoloki mumashi.”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, “Mwizi panu mpikaniri shilii shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Yoshuwa kendereya kulonga, “Vinu hamumaniziwi nakamu handa Mlungu yakawera mkomu kamuwamu mwenu na handa hakawawingi kulongolu kwa mwenga Wakanaani na Wahiti na Wahivi na Waperizi na Wagirigashi na Waamoni na Wayebusi pota kusinda. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa pasipanu poseri lyapakwegera kupita kulongolu kwamwenga kugenda kuloka kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Vinu msyaguli wantu lilongu na mbili kulawa kila likabira lya Israeli, kila likabira muntu yumu. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Shaka nzayu za watambika yawapapa lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mtuwa gwa pasipanu poseri, pazingira mumashi ga lushemba Yoridani, mashi ga lushemba hagaleki kunyililika na galii gagiza uwega wa kushana hagaweri pahala pamuhera handa shidunda.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Su wantu watupuliti malingu gawu wagenda kuloka lushemba Yoridani, watambika yawapapa lisanduku lya lipatanu wawalongoleriti wantu.<verse eid="JOS 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Palaa palii awa yawapapiti lisanduku lya lipatanu pawasokiti Yoridani na zyayu zawu pazitimbiti muunenemu mwa lushemba Yoridani, lushemba lweni lirawa shaka sha kubenanga, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />mashi gaweriti ganyililika kulawa uwega wa kushana gagolokiti na kulimamatira mpaka aku Adamu kushijiji shashiwera pakwegera na mji gwa Saretani. Mashi yagaweriti gankunyililika kugenda bahari ya Araba viraa ishemuwa bahari ya munu, gayumiti nakamu, wantu walokiti kumwambu kwa Yeriku. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Shaka Waisraeli pawaweriti wankuloka, watambika yawaweriti wankulipapa lisandiku lya lipatanu, wagolokiti pahala payuma pakati pa lushemba Yoridani mpaka wantu woseri pawalokiti.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Mabuwi ga maholeru gagolosiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Wantu wa isi yoseri pawalokiti kala lushemba Yoridani, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Gusyaguli wantu lilongu na mbili muwamu mwa Waisraeli, muntu yumu kulawa kila likabila, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />guwalagaliri kutola mabuwi lilongu na mbili kulawa panu pakati pa lushemba Yoridani, kulawa panu pawagolokiti watambika, mgatoli mabuwi aga na kugatula pahala pamgenda kugonja leru.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Su Yoshuwa kawashemiti wantu lilongu na mbili yakawasyaguliti, muntu yumu kulawa kila likabila, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />kawagambira, “Mulilongoleri lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, mpaka pakati palushemba Yoridani. Pamsoka palii Kila yumu gwenu katoli libuwi kapapi paliwega pakuyi, libuwi limu kwajili ya kila likabila lya Israeli. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Shitwatira ashi hashiweri langaliru pakati penu na wananguta wenu pawawakosiya mashaka gagiza, hashi, mabuwi aga gawera na mana gaa kwa mwenga? <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Mwenga hamuwagambiri, lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu palipitiziwitwi lushemba Yoridani, mashi ga lushemba alu gagoloka!’ Su mabuwi aga hagaweri maholu kwa Waisraeli mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Wantu wajimiriti malagira ga Yoshuwa na kutenda shili Mtuwa Mlungu shakamlagaliriti. Womberi watoliti mabuwi lilongu na mbili kulawa pakati pa lushemba Yoridani, libuwi limu kwajili ya kila likabila limu lya Israeli, wagenditi naga mpaka pahala palii pawagonjeriti mwanja gwawu, su wagatula aku. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yoshuwa kagamatika mabuwi lilongu na mbili galii mkati mwa lushemba Yoridani, pahala palii pawagolokiti watambika yawapapiti lisanduku lya lipatanu. Mabuwi aga gawera aku mpaka leru. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Watambika walii yawapapiti lisanduku lya lipatanu, wagolokiti mkati mwa lushemba Yoridani mpaka wantu pawamaliliti kutenda kila shintu shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakamlagaliriti Yoshuwa kawagambiri wantu. Yoshuwa katenditi goseri galii yakagambiziwituwiti na Musa. Wantu walokiti kalongola lushemba, <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />palaa palii wantu woseri pawalokiti kala, lisanduku lya Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na watambika wawalongoleriti wantu. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Wapalu wa likabila lya Rubeni na lya Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi wawalongoleriti Waisraeli pawawera na vikomaniru vyawu, ntambu yakawalagiliriti Musa. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Wantu handa elufu alubaini waweriti kala kwa nkondu wapititi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pawagenda mulularanda lwa mji gwa Yeriku. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Mulishaka lilii Mtuwa Mlungu kamkwisa Yoshuwa kulongolu kwa wantu wa Israeli woseri, na womberi wampanana ligoya Yoshuwa mumakaliru gakuyi goseri ntambu yawampananiti ligoya Musa.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Guwalagaliri watambika yawalipapa lisanduku lya lipatanu walawi mulushemba lya Yoridani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Su Yoshuwa kawagambiriti watambika walii, “Mlawi mulushemba Yoridani,” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />na watambika yawaweriti wapapa lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu pawalawiti pakati pa lushemba Yoridani na kutimba mpeku ya lushemba Yoridani, mashi ga lushemba Yoridani ganja kunyiririka kayi na kumema gambira kwanja.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Wantu awa walokiti lushemba Yoridani mulishaka lya lilongu lya mwezi gwa kwanja na wagenditi kubawira malingu gawu kumji gwa Giligali uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yeriku. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Yoshuwa kagagolusiyiti mabuwi galii lilongu na mawili aku Giligali gagatolitwi kulawa mulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, “Mumashaka gagizaku wananguta wenu pawawakosiyani, hashi, mabuwi aga gawera na mana gaa? <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Su mwenga hamuwawankuli, mabuwi aga gatuholuziya twenga shaka patulokiti lushemba Yoridani pahala papayumiti mashi gakuyi na kugoloka.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Viraa hamuwagambiri kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kagayumiziyiti mashi ga lushemba Yoridani toziya ya mwenga mpaka palii pamlokiti, ntambu yakagayumiziyiti mashi ga bahari ya Shamu toziya ya twenga. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Yomberi katenditi hangu kuwera wantu woseri wa pasipanu wavimani kuwera liwoku lya Mtuwa Mlungu liwera na makakala, su mwenga mumguwiri Mlungu gwenu mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Wafalumi woseri wa Waamori yawalikaliti kumwambu kwa guzyeta mshenji mwa Yoridani na wafalumi woseri wa Wakanaani yawaweriti kumpeku mwa bahari ya Meditireniya, pawapikaniriti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kagayumiziyiti mashi ga lushemba Yoridani kwajili ya Waisraeli mpaka pawalokiti kala, womberi watwezuka twezu na waperuwituwiti makakala nakamu kwa kuwatira Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwingiziwa jandu kwa Waisraeli aku Giligali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Gunyawi vimagi vya mabuwi gakamala su gwawingiziyi jandu Waisraeli.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Su Yoshuwa kanyawiti vimagi avi vya mabuwi makamala na kuwingiziya jandu Waisraeli aku Gibea haaralotihi. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Toziya ya kuwingiziya jandu Waisraeli ndo ayi. Waisreli woseri wapalu yawalawiti Misri yawaweriti na umuli wa kugenda kunkondu, woseri wahowiti mumwanja kushiwala pa kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Woseri walii yawalawiti Misri waingiziwitwi jandu, kumbiti wantu woseri walii yawayiwukiti kushiwala pawaweriti mumwanja kulawa Misri, wingiziwituwiti ndiri jandu. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Waisraeli waweriti mumwanja kwa shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi kushiwala, mpaka wapalu woseri yawaweriti na umuli wa kugenda munkondu wahowiti toziya wapikaniliti ndiri shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kawalapiriti wantu walii kuwera hapeni wayiwoni isi ilii yaiwera na ntundu ziherepa za kuiliziya mifugu na yaiwera na mbotu kwa kulima, isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalapiriti kuwera hakawapanani wazewi wawu. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Hangu ndo iweriti wana awa, weni Mtuwa Mlungu kawaleriti waweri pa womberi, ashi ndo shileri sha syayi sheni Yoshuwa shakashingiziyiti jandu.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Wapalu woseri pakawaingiziyiti kala jandu, su wasigaliti kulikala kumalingu gawu mpaka pawaponiti. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Leru nuwawusilirani mwenga soni ilii ya kuwera aku Misri.” Su pahala palii mpaka leru pashemuwa Giligali.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Waisraeli pawabawiriti malingu aku Giligali mulularanda lyaliwera pakwegera na Yeriku, womberi watenditi msambu gwa Pasaka pashimihi mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi lya mwezi. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Shirawu yakuwi kwa mala ya kwanja waliyiti shiboga shashimeriti Mukanaani, waliyiti ntutu pamuhera na mabumunda yawagalekeluwa ndiri simika. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Shiboga shawashishemiti mana shilekiti kutuluka, na Waisraeli wapatiti ndiri kayi shiboga ashi. Kwanjira shaka shilii womberi waliyiti shiboga shashimeriti Mukanaani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa pamuhera na muntu yakawera na ligumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Lishaka limu Yoshuwa pakaweriti pakwegera na mji gwa Yeriku, kamwoniti muntu kagoloka kulongolu kwakuwi pakawera na ligumba muliwoku lyakuyi. Yoshuwa kamgenderiti yomberi na kumkosiya, “Hashi, gwenga gwa yumu gwa wamashonta watwenga ama gwa wankondu?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Yomberi kamuwankula, “Ndala neni gwenu ndiri pota gwa wankondu wenu. Neni napanu handa mkulu gwa lishonta lya Mtuwa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 5:14">Yoshuwa kasuntamala makukama na kuguwira pakalonga, “Mtuwa gwangu, neni ntumintumi gwaku. Gufira neni ntendi ashi?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Su mkulu gwa lishonta lya Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Guvuli vilwatu vyaku toziya pahala pagugoloka ndo pananagala.” Yoshuwa katenditi ntambu yakalagiritwi.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankugutola kwa makakala mji gwa Yeriku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Migomi mikulu ya kwingira mji gwa Yeriku iweriti itatuwa kuwalewelera Waisraeli nawingira mumji. Kwahera muntu yakaweziti kwingira ama kulawa kunja kwa mji agu. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Guloli, hanikutendi guwutoli kwa makakala mji gwa Yeriku pamuhera na mfalumi gwakuwi na wanjagira wakuwi yawawera wagangamala. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Gwenga pamuhera na wanjagira waku hamuzyengeti mji agu mala yimu kila lishaka kwa mashaka sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Watambika saba, kila yumu katoli lipenga lyakuyi lya ligoli lya kondolu gwa shipalu, hawalongoleri kulongolu kwa lisanduku lya lipatanu. Mulishaka lya saba, gwenga pamuhera na wanjagira waku hamluzyengeti mala saba mji agu, uganu watambika pawagomba mapenga. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Shakapanu womberi hawagombi mapenga kwa liziwu likulu. Palaa palii pampikanira liziwu ali, wantu woseri hawabotangi na vibambaza vya mji haviguwi pasi. Su wanjagila woseri hawingiri mumji.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Su Yoshuwa kawashemiti watambika na kuwagambira, “Mlitoli lisanduku lya lipatanu, na wantu saba pakati penu walilongoleri pawakola mapenga aga ga ligoli lya kondolu.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Yoshuwa kawagambira wantu, “Mgendi kulongolu, mguzyengeti mji, na wantu wana vintu vya kulikomangira wagendi kulongolu kwa lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Yoshuwa pakawalagaliriti kala wantu, watambika saba yawawera na mapenga wanjiti kugendagenda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pawagomba mapenga na kumbeli kwawu pawafatuwa na lisanduku lya lipatanu. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Wanjagira walii yawawera na vintu vya kulikomangira wawalongoleriti watambika yawaweriti wankugomba mapenga, na wanjagira wamonga pawagendagenda kumbeli kulisanduku ali. Shaka shoseri ashi mapenga gaweriti gankugombuwa. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Kumbiti Yoshuwa kawalagaliriti wantu, “Nawabotanga, viraa nawatakula shisoweru mpaka panuwagambira mbotangi, shaka ashi ndo hambotangi.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Su Yoshuwa kawatenditi wantu yawatoliti lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa waguzyengeti mji mala yimu pawalipapa lisanduku. Shakapanu womberi wawuyiti mugonjeru kugonja pashiru.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Mandawira yakuwi Yoshuwa kimukiti ligonugonu, na watambika walipapa lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Watambika saba yawawera na mapenga saba wagenditi kulongolu kulisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu pawagomba mapenga magenda. Wantu yawana vintu vya kulikomangira wawalongoleri watambika na walolera wamonga waweriti kumbeli kulisanduku lya lipatanu. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Lishaka lya pili yakuwi waguzyengetiti mji agu mala yimu na kuwuya kayi mumalingu gawu. Watenditi hangu kwa mashaka sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Lishaka lya saba, womberi wimukiti mandawira pee, waguzyengetiti mji agu mala saba ntambu iraa irii. Iweriti lishaka ali hera pawaguzyengetiti mji agu mala saba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Paisokiti mala ya saba, watambika pawagombiti kala mapenga, Yoshuwa kawagambira wantu, “Mbotangi toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti kala mji agu! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Mji agu pamuhera na kila shintu shashiwera amu hashyagamiziwi, toziya mji gulaviruwa tambiku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Muhumba Rahabu hakasigaluwi pamuhera na woseri yawaweriti mnumba mwakuwi, toziya kawafifiti walolalola wetu. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Kumbiti namtola shintu shoseri shilii shashituluwa toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu su shagamiziwi, handa pamtenda hampati malombu mumalingu ga Israeli kuwera shintu sha kwagamiziwa, hangu kuyijegera madoda. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Shintu shoseri shashinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza ama zahabu ama vyombu vya madini ga shaba, ama madini ga shuma toziya ndo vinanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu su vituluwi muluhanja lwa Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Su watambika wagombiti lipenga. Palaa wantu pawapikaniriti, womberi wabotiti kwa liziwu likulu na vibambaza vya mji vibomukiti. Shakapanu wanjagira woseri wingiliti mumji na kugutola kwa makakala. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Wamlagiti kila muntu yakaweriti mumji, wapalu na wadala na wantemba na wazewi. Vilaa womberi wawalagiti wang'ombi na wakondolu na punda.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yoshuwa kawagambiriti walolalola wawili walii, “Mgendi mnumba ya muhumba ulii, mwakamjegi mdala ulii pamuhera na walongu wakuwi woseri ntambu yamumlapiriti.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Su womberi wagenda kumjega Rahabu, na tati gwakuwi na mawu gwakuwi, na walongu wakuwi woseri, su wawatuliti kunja kumalingu ga Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Shakapanu walulunguziyiti kwa motu lushi lwa Yeriku na kila shintu shashiweriti amu irahera vintu vyavinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza na zahabu na vyombu vya shaba na vintu vya shuma, avi vitulitwi muluhanja lwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Kumbiti Yoshuwa kagalopoziyiti makaliru ga muhumba Rahabu pamuhera na walongu wakuwi, toziya yomberi kawafifiti walolalola wawili walii yawalagalirituwiti kugenda Yeriku. Shiyiwuku sha Rahabu shankulikala mu Israeli mpaka leru.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Shaka ashi Yoshuwa kalirapiriti kulongolu kwa wantu pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">“Yakagunyawa kayi mji gwa Yeriku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">kapangiluwi na Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Muntu yoseri yakatula lyanjiru lwa mji agu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">shipanta njira gwakuwi kahowi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Yoseri yakanyawa ligomi likulu lya mji agu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">shamperu gwakuwi kahowi.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Yoshuwa na zyumi za Yoshuwa zyeniyiti muisi yoseri.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Vidoda vya Akani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Kumbiti Waisraeli waweriti waminika ndiri kuusu vintu virii vyavitulitwi toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu Akani mwana gwa Karimi, kaweriti mwana gwa Zabidi, Zabidi kaweriti mwana gwa Zera yakaweriti gwa likabila lya Yuda, yomberi katoliti vintu vimu vyaviberuwa nakamu. Su maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gawera kwa Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Yoshuwa kawalagalira wantu wamu kulawa Yeriku kukwena kugenda mji gwa Ai yaguweriti pakwegera na Betiaveni kwagulawa mshenji pakwegera na mji gwa Beteli. Yomberi kawagambira, “Mgendi mkailoliloli isi.” Womberi wagenda na kugulolalola mji gwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Womberi pawawuyiti wamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Nagulilagalira shonta lyoseri kugukangala mji gwa Ai, guwalagaliri wantu elufu mbili ama elufu tatu hera su naguwatokiziya. Toziya wenikaya wakuwi watangala ndiri.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Su wantu handa elufu tatu wagenditi kulikomanga na wantu wa mji gwa Ai, kumbiti Waisraeli wawingitwi na wenikaya wa mji agu. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Wapalu wa mji gwa Ai wawawingiti womberi kulawa kuligomi likulu lya mji mpaka Shebarimu na kuwalaga wamonga handa malongu matatu na sita munjira yaiselera kulawa kulugongu. Shakapanu Waisraeli watwezuka twezu na waweriti na lyoga. <verse eid="JOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Yoshuwa pamuhera na walongoziya wa Israeli wapapuliti nguwu zawu na walityelemekiti litapaka mumituyi mwawu na wasuntamiti makukama mpaka pashimihi kulongolu kwa lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Su Yoshuwa kalonga, “Shondi shondi twenga, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu! Iwera hashi gutulosiya mulushemba Yoridani na kututenda tulaguwi na Waamori? Meyiherepi twenga kusigala kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, ntakuli shishi, vinu Waisraeli watuga kulawa kwa wankondu wawu? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Wakanaani pamuhera na wenikaya woseri wa isi ayi pawapikanira shisoweru ashi hawatuzyengeti na kutuhowiziya nakamu pasipanu. Vinu hagutendi shishi kulanguziya ukulu wa litawu lyaku?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, “Gugoloki! Iwera hashi gusuntama makukama ntambu ayi? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Waisraeli watenda vidoda, toziya waleka lilagaliru lyangu lyanuwalagaliriti walikoli. Wavitola vintu vimu vyavitulituwiti toziya ya neni, wiwa na kufifa na wavitula pamuhera na vintu vyawu. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Kwa ntambu ayi Waisraeli hapeni wawezi kuwakomanga wankondu wawu, wankutuga kulawa kwa wankondu wawu toziya walitenda weni kuwera shintu sha kwagamiziwa. Pamuvyagamiziya ndiri nakamu vintu vyavilaviluwitwi vyagamiziwi pakati penu, neni hapeni weri pamuhera na womberi kayi. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Gwimuki! Guwagambiri Waisraeli walipungi na kulitandira kwiza kwa neni shilawu. Guwagambiri kuwera neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli nonga hangu, wantu wa Israeli nuwalagaliriti mwenga mwagamiziyi kila shintu mumji gwa Yeriku. Kumbiti mwenga muvisigaliti vintu vimu vyanuwalagaliriti muvyagamizi! Hapeni muwezi kuwakomanga wankondu wenu mpaka vintu avi pamuviwusiya.’<verse eid="JOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Shilawu mandawira mwawoseri hamwizi kulongolu kwaneni likabila kwa likabila. Likabila lyanilisyaguli haligendi kulongolu, lukolu kwa lukolu. Lukolu lyanilusyaguli haligendi kulongolu, kaya kwa kaya. Na kaya yaniyisyaguli hayigendi kulongolu, muntu yumu kwa yumu. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Muntu yoseri yakawera na vintu vyavileweleritwi, hakalunguziwi nakamu kwa motu, yomberi pamuhera na kila shintu shakuwi toziya kalilema lilagaliru lyangu neni Mtuwa Mlungu, katenda shitwatira sha soni Muisraeli.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Su Yoshuwa kimuka mandawira putiputi, kawajojonira Waisraeli woseri pakwegera, likabila kwa likabila, likabila lya Yuda lisyagulitwi. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Kazijega pakwegera nkolu za Yuda, lukolu kwa lukolu na lukolu lwa Zerahi lusyagulitwi. Kazijega pakwegera kaya za lukolu lwa Zerahi, kaya kwa kaya na kaya za Zabidi isyagulitwi. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Yoshuwa kayijega pakwegera kaya ya Zabida, muntu kwa muntu, Akani mwana gwa Karimi na Karimi kaweriti mwana gwa Zabidi na Zabidi kaweriti mwana gwa Zera gwa likabila lya Yuda, lisyagulitwi. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yoshuwa kamgambiriti Akani, “Mwana gwangu, gutakuli nakaka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. Gutakuli vinu shilii shagutenditi, nagunfifa.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani kamwankula, “Ndo nakaka,” “Ntenda vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. Hangu ndo ntambu yantenditi. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Pamoniti nguwu yimu iherepa kulawa Shinari na vipandi miya mbili za madini ga feza na muchi gwa zahabu gwana utopa wa nusu kilu, nuvifiriti na kuvitola, nivibawira pasi muliringu lyangu, na madini ga feza gapasi pa vintu avi.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Su Yoshuwa kawalagalira wantu na womberi watugiriti kugenda muliringu lya Akani, kulii waviwoniti vintu virii vififwa muliringu na madini ga feza gawera pasi pakuyi. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Womberi wavitoliti kulawa muliringu lilii na kumjegera Yoshuwa na wantu woseri wa Israeli, na womberi wavitula pasi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri, wamtoliti Akani mwana gwa Zera, mweni pamuhera na madini ga feza na nguwu irii na zahabu, wana wakuwi wapalu na wahinga wakuwi na wang'ombi na punda na kondolu wakuwi, liringu lyakuyi na kila shintu shakaweriti nashi na kuwajega kulularanda lya Akori. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yoshuwa kamkosiya Akani, “Iwera hashi gutujegera ntabiku? Mtuwa Mlungu hakakujegeri ntabiku gamweni gwenga leru.” Waisraeli woseri wamgumangiti mabuwi Akani mpaka kahowa. Viraa wawagumangiti mabuwi kaya yakuwi yoseri kwa mabuwi mpaka wahowa, wawalunguziyiti nakamu woseri kwa motu. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Shakapanu wagamamatira mabuwi gavuwa pampindi pakuwi, mabuwi galii gawera aku mpaka leru. Su palii maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gapola na pahala palii mpaka leru pashemuwa lularanda lya Akori.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Mji gwa Ai gwakwagamiziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, “Nagutira, viraa naguwera na lyoga lyoseri, guwatoli wamashonta waku woseri gugendi kumji gwa Ai. Toziya hanikutendi gumkanki mfalumi gwa Ai pamuhera na wantu wakuwi, mji gwakuwi na isi yakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Hamgutenderi mji gwa Ai pamuhera na mfalumi gwakuwi ntambu yamugutendiriti mji wa Yeriku pamuhera na mfalumi gwakuyi. Ulunda wakuyi pamuhera na mifugu yakuyi yanamuyilopoli hayiweri ndo lunda yenu. Mgendi mkagutoli kwa makakala mji kulawa uwega wa kumbeli.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Su Yoshuwa kawuka pamuhera na wamashonta wakuyi woseri wagenda Ai. Kawasyagula wantu wagangamala elufu selasini na kawagambira walongoleri pashiru. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Kawagambira hangu, “Mwenga mgunyatili mji kulawa uwega wa kumbeli. Kumbiti namgenda kutali na mji, su muweri kala shaka shoseri. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Neni pamuhera na wantu woseri yawawera pamuhera na neni, hatugusegeleri mji. Wantu pawalawa kunja kwiza kutukomanga handa kwanja, twenga hatuwatiri. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Nawomberi hawendereyi kutufata mpaka waweri patali na mji gwawu, toziya hawaliholi watuwinga ntambu yawatenditi shaka shipititi. Twenga hatuwaleki watuwingiwingi. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Panu mwenga hamlawiri kulawa aku kwamweriti mgunyatiri na kugutola mji kwa makakala. Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hakawatendi muukanki mji agu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Pamgutola kala kwa makakala mji, hamgulunguziyi nakamu kwa motu, handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti. Guloli! Aga ndo malagaliru gakufata.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Su Yoshuwa kawagambiriti womberi wagendi pahala pawu pa kuwagwandira na womberi walitula uwega kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa mji gwa Ai pakati pa mji gwa Ai na Bateli. Kumbiti Yoshuwa kagonjiti pashiru kulii kumalingu ga Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Yoshuwa kimuka mandawira putiputi, kawajojonira Waisraeli na kugenda kumjini Ai pakawera pamuhera na wazewi. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Mashonta woseri yawagenditi pamuhera na Yoshuwa, waweriti pakwegera na mji na kunyawa malingu kushana kwakuyi, na lularanda luweriti pakati pawu na mji gwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawasyagula wantu elufu muhanu na kuwatula wagwandili pakati pa mji gwa Beteli na Ai, uwega kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa mji gwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Shipinga sha wamashonta shitulitwi kushana mwa mji na walii yawasigaliti, wawatuliti kusika wankukwandira mji. Kumbiti pashiru panu, Yoshuwa kagenditi kulularanda. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Mandawira putiputi Mfalumi gwa mji gwa Ai pakawoniti hangu, kalopokeriti na kugenda kuluseleru lwalugenda Araba su walikomangiti nkondu na Wasraeli. Kumbiti kavimaniti ndiri handa mji gwakuwi guweriti gukangaluwa kulawa kumbeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli woseri walitenditi handa wankusinda, wanja kutugira kushiwala. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Wantu woseri yawaweriti mjini washemitwi wawafati Waisraeli, na pawaweriti wankumfata Yoshuwa, walawiti na kugenda patali na mji gwawu. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Kwahera muntu yoseri yakasigaliti kumjini Ai ama Beteli, wagulekiti mji agu lupalahera wagenda kuwafata Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, “Gulanguziyi mgoha gwaku aku kumjini Ai toziya hanikutendi guukanki mji agu.” Yoshuwa kagulanguziya mgoha gwakuwi kumjini Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Kamkamu Yoshuwa pakagulanguziyiti mgoha gwakuwi kulii Ai, shipinga shashiweriti shankugwandira uwega umonga shilawa na kwingira kumjini, wagutola mji kwa makakala mji na kugulunguziya nakamu kwa motu. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Wantu wa mji gwa Ai pawagalambukiti kumbeli, waliwona lyosi kulawa kumjini palituma kugenda kulyera. Womberi waweriti ndiri na uwezu wa kutuga uwega woseri, toziya Waisraeli wawagalambukiriti awa yawaweriti wankuwafata. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yoshuwa na Waisraeli woseri pawawoniti kuwera shipinga shashiweriti shakugwandira shigutola kwa makakala mji na lyosi liweriti lyankutuma kugenda kulyera, wawagalambukiriti na kwanja kuwalaga wantu wa mji gwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Wantu wa Israeli yawaweriti wagutola kwa makakala mji gwa Ai walawa na kuwafata wantu wa Ai na walii yawaweriti wangutuga wagulambukiti hangu wantu wa Ai waliwoniti wapakati pa mashonta ga Israeli na Waisraeli wawalaga woseri pota kumleka hata muntu yumu. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Ai wambatiti kwa makakala pakawera mkomu na kumjega kwa Yoshuwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Waisraeli pawamalaliti kuwalaga wantu woseri wa mji gwa Ai kulii kushidohi kwawawafatiti, su wawuyiti kumjini Ai na kuwalaga woseri yawasigaliti amu. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Walanga ya wantu wa mji gwa Ai yawalagitwi lishaka lilii, wapalu pamuhera na wadala waweriti elufu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Yoshuwa kalilekeziyiti ndiri liwoku lyakuyi lyakagukoliti mgoha gwakuwi kugulanguziya kumjini Ai mpaka pawawalagiti wenikaya woseri wa mji agu. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Waisraeli watoliti hera kwa makakala wakanyama na lunda gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Yoshuwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Su Yoshuwa kagulunguziyiti nakamu kwa motu mji gwa Ai na kugutenda magofu mpaka leru. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Shakapanu kamkongera mfalumi gwa mji gwa Ai mumtera mpaka pashimihi. Kumbiti mshenji pagwanjiti kwinala, Yoshuwa kalongiti mauti gakuyi gawusiwi kumtera na kwaswa kunja kuligomi likulu lyakwingilira kumji. Shakapanu wamamatiri limatiru likulu lya mabuwi pampindi pa mauti ga mfalumi ayu, limatiru ali lyankali mpaka leru.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagiru lyankubetuluwa Kulugongu Ebali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kamnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, pahala pakutambikira Kulugongu Ebali, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />gambira Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakawalagaliriti Waisraeli, ntambu yailembitwi mushintola sha lagiru lya Musa handa hapaweri pakutambikira papanyawituwi kwa mabuwi galii gagasongolituwiti ndiri, pota kushinkuluwa na shombu shoseri sha shuma. Pampindi pa kutambikira palii wamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za kulunguziwa nakamu pamuhera na malaviwu ga ponga. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Na aku, kulongolu kwa lipinga lya wantu woseri wa Israeli, Yoshuwa kalembiti kayi lagaliru lya Musa pampindi pa mabuwi. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Waisraeli woseri pamuhera na wakulu wawu, wazewi na watoza na wahenga woseri yawaweriti pakati pawu, wagolokiti kila uwega pakwegera na lisanduku lya lipatanu kulongolu kwa Walawi yawaweriti watambika, walii yawalipapati lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Wamu wawu wagoloka kulola kulugongu Gerizimu na wamonga wagolokiti kulola kulugongu Ebali, gambira viraa Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakalagaliriti mashaka gapititi ga kutekeleruwa kwa Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawabetulira Malagaliru goseri, pamuhera na matekeleru na mpangiru ntambu yailembitwi mushintola sha malagaliru. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Kwahera shisoweru shashilagaliritwi na Musa, shilii Yoshuwa kashibetula ndiri kulongolu kwa lipinga lya Waisraeli, muwamu mwawu waweriti wadala, wana na wahenga yawaweriti wankulikala pamuhera nawu.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Lipatanu lya upayira lya wantu wa Gibeyoni kwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Wafalumi woseri yawaweriti kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani muisi ya kumigongu na kulularanda na enewu lyoseri ya mpeku za bahari ya Mediteraniya kulola Lebanoni na Wahiti na Waamori na Wakanaani na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi, pawapikaniriti visoweru vya Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Walijojonira pamuhera kwa nfiru yimu su kulikomanga nkondu na Yoshuwa pamuhera na Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Kumbiti wenikaya wa Gibeyoni pawapatiti shisoweru kuusu Yoshuwa ntambu yakayitenditi miji ya Yeriku na Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />womberi wamuwa kutenda upayira. Watandira viboga, wakweneziya malobota gasakaliti panani pa punda wawu, muvihaku vya lukuli visakaliti na kusonuwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Wavala vilwatu na nguwu zyazisakaliti na viboga vyawu vyoseri viweriti viyuma vyavimeriti ukungu. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Su wamgendera Yoshuwa kuliringu aku Giligali, wamgambira yomberi pamuhera na Waisraeli, “Twenga tulawa isi ya kutali nentu, shondi mtendi lipatanu pamuhera na twenga.” <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Kumbiti Waisraeli wawankula Wahivi, “Hatuwezi hashi kutenda lipatanu na mwenga? Pamonga mwenga mulikala pakwegera na twenga” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Na womberi wamgambira Yoshuwa, “Twenga twantumintumi waku.” Yoshuwa kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwenga mwashina gaa na mlawa koshi?” <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Womberi wamwankula, “Twenga wantumintumi waku, tulawa isi ya kutali nentu, twiza toziya tupikinira zyumi za litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, tupatiti visoweru vya umanika wakuwi na goseri gakatenditi muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Tupikaniriti vyoseri vyakawatendiriti wafalumi walii wa Waamori, yawaweriti kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani, mfalumi Sihoni gwa Heshiboni pamuhera na mfalumi gwa Ogu gwa Bashani yakalikaliti aku Ashitaroti. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Ndo wazewi wetu pamuhera na wenikaya woseri wa isi yetu, watugambiriti tutoli viboga vya mwanja, twizi tuliwoni na mwenga na kuwagambira twenga ndo wantumintumi wenu, shondi mtendi lipatanu na twenga. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Guloli mabumunda getu gaweriti gankali motu patugatoliti shaka patuwukiti ukaya kwetu, kumbiti vinu gayuma na kumera ukungu. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Vihaku vyavinyatwi kwa lukuli ali tuvimemiziyiti divayi paviwera vyasyayi, kumbiti vinu idegeka. Ata nguwu pamuhera na vilwatu vyetu visakala toziya mwanja guweriti mtali nentu.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Su Waisraeli watoliti viboga virii pota ya kumkosiya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Yoshuwa katenditi nawu mapatanu ga ponga, katenditi lipatanu kuwera hakawajimili walikali. Walonguziya wa shipinga sha Waisraeli wawalapiriti kugatenda mapatanu aga.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Mashaka matatu pa kutenda lipatanu na womberi, Waisraeli wayambuliti kuwera wantu walii waweriti wapakwegera wawu na walikaliti muwamu mwawu. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Su Waisraeli wanja mwanja, pa mashaka matatu wasokiti mumiji yawu. Miji ayi iweriti Gibioni na Kefira na Beerotihi na Kiriyati yearimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Kumbiti Waisraeli wawalagiti ndiri, toziya walongoziya wa Waisraeli wawalapiriti kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli. Su Waisraeli woseri yawahinginikiyiti walongoziya wawu. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Kumbiti walongoziya wa Waisraeli washigambiriti shipinga sha wantu wau, “Toziya tuwalapiriti kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, vinu hapeni tuwalagi. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Hatuwaleki walikali su natwiza kwazibiwa toziya ya kulirapa kwatutenditi. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Muwaleki walikali.” Su Wagibeyoni waweriti wankuwatendera wantu woseri wa Israeli, pawawabawulira mbawu na kuwatekera mashi, handa walongoziya wa Waisraeli ntambu yawalongiti.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Yoshuwa kawashema Wagibeyoni na kuwakosiya, “Ntambu hashi mtuzyangiti kuwera mlawiti isi ya kutali, uganu mwenga mulikala muwamu mwetu? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Vinu mwenga mpangiruwa na wamu wenu mashaka goseri hamuweri wamanda wa kubawula mbawu na kuteka mashi kwajili ya Numba ya Mlungu gwangu.” <verse eid="JOS 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Womberi wamwankula Yoshuwa, “Tugambiluwa kuwera nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kamlagaliriti Musa ntumintumi gwakuwi kawagamiziyi wenikaya woseri wa isi ayi na kuwapanana mwenga isi ayi iweri yenu. Su twenga tuweriti na lyoga nentu kuusu makaliru getu, ndo mana tutenditi shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Vinu twenga tuwera mumakakala gaku, gututenderi ntambu yaguwona iherepa.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Su Yoshuwa kawalopuziyiti na kalekiti ndiri walaguwi na Waisraeli, na Waisraeli wawagamiziyiti ndiri. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Kumbiti kwanjira lishaka lilii, Yoshuwa kawatenditi womberi waweri wabawula mbawu pamuhera na wateka mashi kwajili ya shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli, viraa kwajili ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pakapasyaguliti. Shitwatira ashi shiwera mpaka leru.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Waamori wankusinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Mfalumi Adonizedeki gwa Yerusalemu kapikaniriti visoweru vya Yoshuwa ntambu yakagutoliti kwa makakala mji gwa Ai na ntambu yakaguharabisiyiti nakamu na kumlaga mfalumi na ntambu yakagutenderiti Yeriku pamuhera na mfalumi gwakuwi. Viraa kapatiti visoweru kuwera wenikaya wa Gibeyoni waweriti watenda lipatanu lya ponga na Waisraeli na vinu walikala muwamu mwawu. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Visoweru avi viwatenditi kuweri na lyoga likulu aku Yerusalemu toziya mji gwa Gibiyoni guweriti gumanika handa mji yagwana mfalumi. Mji agu guweriti gumanikana nentu kuliku mji gwa Ai na wapalu woseri yawalikaliti amu waweriti mashonta wagangamala. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Su Mfalumi Adonizedeki kalagaliriti milagilagi kwa mfalumi Hohamu gwa aku Hebroni, na kwa mfalumi Piramu gwa Yarimuti, na kwa mfalumi Yafiya gwa Lakishi na kwa mfalumi Debiri gwa Egiloni, yomberi kawagambiriti, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Mwizi muntangi tuwagamiziyi Wagibiyoni, toziya watenda lipatanu lya ponga na Yoshuwa pamuhera na Waisraeli.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Shakapanu wafalumi walii wamuhanu wa Waamori waweriti, mfalumi gwa Yerusalemu na mfalumi gwa Hebroni na mfalumi gwa Yarimuti na mfalumi gwa Lakishi na mfalumi gwa Egiloni, woseri wagajojonira pamuhera mashonta gawu, wagenda naga mpaka Gibiyoni, wabawira malingu waguzyengeta mji agu, wagukomangaliti.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Wagibiyoni wajegiti visoweru kwa Yoshuwa kuliringu aku Giligali, wamgambira, “Shondi shondi, nagutuleka twenga wantumintumi waku, gwizi kalongola gututangi na kutulopoziya toziya wafalumi woseri wa Waamori kulawa isi ya kumigongu wiza kutukangala.” <verse eid="JOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Su Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi lyoseri na wagangamala wawuka Giligali. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, “Naguwatira ata shididini toziya nikutenda guwakanki, kwahera ata yumu hakawezi kukusegelera.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi pa kugendagenda pashiru poseri kulawa Giligali kukwena kugenda Gibiyoni, wawalawiriti vumu kuwakangala Waamori. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu kawazugiziyiti Waamori waweri na lyoga kulongolu kwa Waisraeli, walii wawalagiti wantu wavuwa aku Gibiyoni pawawawingiti kunjira ya luseleru lwa Betihoroni mpaka Azeka na Makeda kulii, viraa wawalagiti wantu wavuwa nentu. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Pawaweriti wankuwatira Waisraeli kuluseleru lwa Betihoroni, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatowera mvula ya mabuwi makulu kulawa kulyera pawawera kunjira mpaka Azeka ata walaguwa kwa mabuwi aga wawera wavuwa kuliku yawalaguwitwi kwa vintu vya kulikomangira vya Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Shaka Mtuwa Mlungu pakawatenditi Waisraeli wawakanki Waamori, Yoshuwa kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kulongolu kwa Waisraeli woseri pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Gwenga mshenji gugoloki pampindi pa mji gwa Gibiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">gwenga lyezi gugoloki mulularanda lwa Aiyaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Su mshenji gugolokiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">na lyezi viraa ligolokiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">mpaka Waisraeli pawawakankiti wankondu wawu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">Shitwatira ashi shilembitwi mushintora sha Yashari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">Mshenji gugolokiti kulyera na guyoyiti kugenda kwinara lishaka lyoseri. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Lishaka gambira ali halyeniweri nakamu, viraa halyeniwoneki kayi, lishaka lilii Mtuwa Mlungu kamjimilira muntu kwa ntambu ayi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kaweriti uwega wa Waisraeli kulikomanga nkondu.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawuyiti kumalingu aku Giligali pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuwalaga wafalumi wamuhanu wa Waamori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Wafalumi wamuhanu walii watugiti na kulififa mulipanga aku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Yoshuwa kapatiti visoweru kuwera wafalumi mhanu walii wayambulwa kwawalififiti mulipanga aku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yoshuwa kalonga, “Mubiringisiyi mabuwi makulu kuligomi lya mpanga na kutula walolera palii. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Kumbiti mwenga namulikala aku, muwafati wankondu wenu. Muwakomangi yawawera kumbeli, namuwaleka wingili mijini mwawu, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawatenda muwakanki.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lya Israeli wawakomiti na kuwagamiziya woseri na wadidika wawu yawasigaliti watugiriti kumiji yawu yaiwera na maboma. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Pagaperiti aga Waisraeli woseri pota kutenduwa wawuyiti kwa Yoshuwa kumalingu aku Makeda na kwahera muntu yakajeriti kutenda shoseri kwa Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kalonga, “Muwusiyi mabuwi kuligomi lya mpanga munjegeri kulawa amu wafalumi wamuhanu walii.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Womberi watenditi ntambu yawalagaliritwi, wamjegera Yoshuwa wafalumi wamuhanu walii. Mfalumi gwa Yerusalemu na mfalumi gwa Hebroni na mfalumi gwa Yarimuti na mfalumi gwa Lakishi na mfalumi gwa Egiloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Wafalumi walii pawajegitwi, Yoshuwa kawashemiti Waisraeli woseri na wakulu wa mashonta yawagenditi pamuhera kunkondu, kawagambira, “Mwizi pakwegera muwatimbangi wafalumi awa musingu mwawu.” Na womberi wasegelera na kuwatimbanga musingu. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yoshuwa kawagambira wakulu walii, “Namtira, viraa namshashatika, mwenga mkamalili na mgangamali, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu hangu ndo ntambu hakawatenderi wankondu wenu woseri yamgenda kulikomanga nawa. Su muweri wakamalira na wagangamala.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawalagiti na kuwatyetiziya kumitera mihanu kulii na kawalekiti kulii mpaka pashimi. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Shaka mshenji paguweriti pakwegera kuzyeta, Yoshuwa kalagaliriti wawawusiwi pampindi pa mitera pawawatetyeziyiti na kuwasa mulipanga kwawalififiti. Shakapanu womberi watuliti mabuwi makulu kuligomi lya mpanga, na mabuwi aga gakulaa aku mpaka leru.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuitola kwa makakala miji ya kusika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Lishaka ali Yoshuwa pakagutoliti kwa makakala mji gwa Makeda, kamlagiti mfalumi pamuhera na wenikaya woseri pota kumsigaliziya ata muntu yumu. Kamtenderiti mfalumi gwa Makeda ntambu yakamtenderiti mfalumi gwa Yeriku.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli walawiti Makeda na wagenditi mji gwa Libina wagukangaliti. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenda shonta lya Israeli wagukanki mji gulii pamuhera na mfalumi gwawu, wawalagiti wenikaya wa mji gulii pota kumsigaliziya ata muntu yumu. Wamtenderiti mfalumi gwa Libina ntambu yawamtenderiti mfalumi gwa Yeriku.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Su kulawa Libina Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli wagenditi Lakishi, waguzyengetiti na kugukangala. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenditi shonta lya Israeli wagukanki mji gulii gwa Lakishi, wagutoliti kwa makakala mulishaka lya pili. Wawalagiti wenikaya woseri wa mji gulii ntambu yawatenditi kulii Libina. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Palii mfalumi Horamu gwa Gezeri kaamuwa kwiza kuwatanga wantu wa Lakishi. Kumbiti Yoshuwa kamlagiti pamuhera na wantu wakuwi woseri, kamleka ndiri ata muntu yumu.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli walawiti Lakishi na kugenda Egiloni, waguzyengetiti mji agu gwa Eligoni na kugukangala. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Wagutoliti kwa makakala lishaka liraa lilii na kuwalaga wenikaya woseri ntambu yawatenditi kulii Lakishi.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli walawiti Egiloni na kugenda Hebroni, wagukangaliti mji agu gwa Hebroni na kugukomanga. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Na kugutola kwa makakala, wawalagiti wenikaya woseri pamuhera na mfalumi gwawu, wayihalabisiyiti nakamu miji imonga yaizyengetitwi, wawalaga wenikaya wakuwi woseri ntambu yawatenditi kulii Egiloni.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli wawuyiti Debiri, wagukangaliti mji agu. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Womberi wagutoliti kwa makakala mji pamuhera na mfalumi gwakuwi, pamuhera na miji imonga yoseri yaiguzyengetiti na kuwagamiziya woseri yawaweriti amu pota kumleka ata muntu yumu. Wagutenderiti mji agu ntambu yawagutenderiti mji gwa Hebroni na mji gwa Libina na wafalumi wawu.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Su Yoshuwa katoliti kwa makakala isi yoseri, kawakanga wafalumi wa semu za migongu, enewu lya Negebu na semu za isi laranda na miseleru. Kaleka ndiri shoseri shashiwera shikomu, kalagiti kila shintu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yoshuwa kawakankiti munkondu ayi yimu kulawa Kadeshi Barineya mpaka Gaza na kulawa Gosheni mpaka Gibiyoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Kaweziti kuyitola isi ayi yoseri toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli kaweriti uwega wa Waisraeli kuwakomangira. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Su Yoshuwa kawuyiti kumalingu aku Giligali pamuhera na shonta lyoseri lya Israeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuwakanka wafalumi wa kushana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Mfalumi Yabini gwa Mji gwa Hazori pakapatiti visoweru avi, kajegiti visoweru kwa mfalumi Yobabu gwa Madoni na mfalumi gwa Shimironi na mfalumi gwa Akishafi. <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />Viraa kajegiti visoweru kwa wafalumi yawaweriti kumigongu ya kushana na walii yawaweriti Araba, Araba iweriti kusika mwa Kinereti, kulularanda na wafalumi yawaweriti Nafatidori muuwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Mfalumi Yabini viraa kajegiti visoweru kwa Wakanaani yawaweriti wega za kwagulawa mshenji na kwaguzyeta mshenji, kwa Waamori na Wahiti na Waperizi na Wayebusi yawalikaliti mumigongu na kwa Wahivi yawalikaliti muluseleru lwa lugongu Herimoni muisi ya Mizipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Su walawiti woseri na mashonta gawu goseri. Womberi waweriti wavuwa gambira muhanga gwa kumpeku mwa bahari pamuhera na mbutuka zivuwa na farasi wavuwa nentu. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Wafalumi woseri awa walijimiraniti pamuhera na kubawira malingu gawu pakwegera na mubwiru za mashi aku Meromu su walikomangi nkondu na Waisraeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Naguwatira womberi toziya shirawu, shaka gambira ashi, haniwagamiziyi woseri kwa kuwatenda Waisraeli wawakanki, na mwenga hamuidumulangi mishipa ya magulu ga kumbeli ga farasi wawu na kulunguziya nakamu kwa motu mbutuka zawu zyazikwegwa na farasi.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Su Yoshuwa pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi lyoseri walawiriti na kuwakangila vumu kumbwiru ya aku Meromu. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenda shonta lya Israeli liwakanki wankondu wawu, wawakomangiti na kuwawinga mpaka aku Sidoni nkulu na Misirefotimaimu, mpaka uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mulularanda lwa Mizipa. Makomangu gendereyiti mpaka wankondu woseri pawalagwitwi woseri. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yoshuwa katenditi shilii shakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, kaidumuliti mishipa ya magulu ga kumbeli ga farasi wawu na kuzilunguziya nakamu kwa motu mbutuka zawu zyazikwegwa na farasi. <verse eid="JOS 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Yoshuwa pakaweriti kankuwuya, kagutoliti kwa makakala mji gwa Hazori. Kamlagiti mfalumi gwa mji agu toziya ndo yakaweriti mlongoziya gwa falumi zoseri azi. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Shakapanu kawalagiti wenikaya woseri wa mji gulii na kagulunguziya nakamu kwa motu mji gwa Hazori na kamlekiti ndiri ata muntu yumu. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Viraa kayitoliti kwa makakala miji ilii imonga yoseri na kuwalaga wafalumi woseri wa miji ilii handa Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgaliriti. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Kumbiti Shonta lya Israeli wayilunguziyiti ndiri miji yaiweriti kuvigongu vyavirawiriti na mahami gawu, su hera mji gwa Hazori gulii Yoshuwa kaguluziyiti nakamu kwa motu. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Waisraeli watoliti vintu vyoseri vyawavitoliti kwa makakala pamuhera na wankanyama wa kulolerwa wa miji ayi, kumbiti wawalagiti wenikaya wakuwi woseri, pota kuleka ata shoseri shikomu. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagaliriti Musa ntumintumi gwakuwi, Musa viraa kamlagaliriti Yoshuwa, Yoshuwa kagajimiriti malagalira goseri. Katendiiti kila shintu shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi zyazitolitwi kwa makakala na Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Yoshuwa kayitoliti kwa makakala isi yoseri. Katoliti semu za kumigongu na semu zoseri za Negebu, enewu loseri lya Gosheni na isi laranda, isi ya Araba, migongu ya Israeli na semu zyakuwi zyaziwera kulularanda. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Yomberi kazitoliti kwa makakala na kuwalaga wafalumi woseri wa isi azi kwanjira lugongu lwaluweriti lwahera shintu lwa aku Halaki pakwegera na Seiri mpaka Baaligadi mulularanda lwa Lebanoni, kusika mwa lugongu Herimoni. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Nkondu yakalikomangiti Yoshuwa pamuhera na wafalumi woseri walii iweriti ya shaka shitangala kupela. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Kwahera mji yagutenditi mapatanu ga ponga na Waisraeli, kumbiti hera mji gwa Gidiyoni, gulii gwawalikaliti Wahivi. Waisraeli wayitoliti kwa makakala miji imonga yoseri kwa kulikomanga nkondu. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Iweriti nfiru ya Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kuyikamaziya miyoyu ya wantu wa maisi aga su walikomangi nkondu. Kafiliti nawawoneruwa lusungu kumbiti walaguwi. Hangu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="JOS 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Shaka shilii Yoshuwa kagenditi na kawagamiziyiti Waanaki yawalikaliti mumigongu aku Hebroni na Debiri na Anabu, isi yoseri ya vigongu vya Yuda na Israeli. Yoshuwa kawagamiziyiti wantu walii pamuhera na miji yawu. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Kwahera muntu gwa likabila lya Anaki yakasigaliti muisi ya Israeli, wasigaliti wadidika hera mumiji ya Gaza na Gati na Ashidodi.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Su Yoshuwa kayitoliti kwa makakala isi yoseri kulinganira na goseri galii Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. Yoshuwa kawapananiti Waisraeli iweri yawu, walibagulila kulinganira na makabila gawu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Israeli woyeriti na nkondu.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Wafalumi yawasinditi kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Awa ndo wafalumi walii Waisraeli wawakankiti na kutola kwa makakala isi yawu yoseri yaiweriti kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani kulawa lularanda lwa lushemba Arinoni mpaka lugongu Herimoni na isi yoseri ya Araba uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori yakalikaliti aku Heshiboni na kakolitimlima aku Aroeri, mji yaguweriti mumbwega ya lularanda lwa Arinoni. Kakolitimlima viraa kwanjira pakati pa lularanda mpaka lushemba Yaboki, lushemba lulii luweriti mbaka ya isi ya Waamoni, ndo ilii nusu ya isi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Viraa virii kakolitimlima isi yoseri ya Araba, kulawa bahari ya Kinereti, uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji, mpaka Beti yeshimoti bahari ya munu na kwendeleya mpaka isi ya luseleru lwa lugongu Pisiga. <verse eid="JOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Yumonga ndo mfalumi Ogu yumu gwa Warefai yawasigaliti, ulii kakolitimlima Bashani na kalikaliti Ashitaroti na Edireyi. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Ukolamlima wakuwi ueneyiti aku kulugongu Herimoni aku Saleka, Bashani yoseri mpaka mumbaka ya Wageshuri na Wamaaka na nusu ya Gileyadi mpaka mumbaka mwa isi ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Heshiboni. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na Waisraeli wawakankiti wafalumi awa, kagapananiti isi azi makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi iweri yawu nakamu.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafalumi yawasinditi na Joshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Shapanu Yoshuwa pamuhera na Waisraeli wawakankiti wafalumi woseri wa enewu lyaliwera kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani, kwanjira Baaligadi mulularanda lwa Lebanoni mpaka lugongu lwaluhera shintu lwa Halaki kusika pakwegera na Seiri. Yoshuwa kagapananiti makabila ga Israeli isi zilii ziweri zawu nakamu. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Isi azi ziweriti pamuhera na semu za vigongu, Isi laranda enewu lya Araba na miseleru ya migongu, maenewu ga shiwala na enewu lya Negebu, isi yaziweriti za Wahiti na Waamori na Wakanaani na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Waisraeli wawakankiti wafalumi awa. Mfalumi yumu gwa Yeriku na mfalumi yumu gwa Ai mji yaguwera pakwegera na Beteli. <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Yerusalemu na mfalumi yumu gwa Hebroni, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Yarimiti na mfalumi yumu gwa Lakishi. <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Eguloni na mfalumi yumu gwa Gezeri, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Debiri na mfalumi yumu gwa Gederi. <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Horima na mafalumi yumu gwa Aradi, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Libina na mfalumi yumu gwa Adulamu <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Makeda na mfalumi yumu gwa Beteli. <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Tapuwa na mfalumi yumu gwa Heferi <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Afeka na mfalumi yumu gwa Lasharoni na <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />mfalumi yumu gwa Madoni na mfalumi yumu gwa Hazori. <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Shimirunimeroni na mfalumi yumu gwa Akishafi <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />na mfalumi yumu gwa Taanaki na mfalumi yumu gwa Megido. <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Kadeshi na mfalumi yumu gwa Yokineamu mji yaguwera kulugongu Karimeli na <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />mfalumi yumu gwa Dori mumkowa gwa Nafatidori na mfalumi yumu gwa Goiimu aku Giligali na <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />mfalumi yumu gwa Tiriza. Walanga ya wafalumi awa iweriti malongu matatu na yimu.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Isi hayenetoluwi kwa makakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Yoshuwa kaweriti mgongolu gwa vinja vivuwa. Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, “Gwenga vinu guwera mgongolu gwa vinja vivuwa na kusigala semu nkulu za isi hazyenitolowu kwa makakala. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Isi yaisigaliti ndo isi yoseri ya Wafilisti na Wageshuri, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />viraa ndo isi lilii lyalimanika handa lya Wakanaani, kwanjira shishemba lwa Shiholi mumbaka mwa Misri mpaka isi ya Ekroni kushana aku, isi yoseri ya wakolamlima muhanu wa Ufilisti mu Gaza na Ashidodi na Ashikeloni na Gati na Ekroni pamuhera na isi ya Waavi uwega wa kusika. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Ntambu iraa isi za Wakanaani kwanjira Ara ya Wasidoni mpaka Afeki mumbaka mwa Waamori. <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />Ntambu iraa ilii isi ya Gebali kwagulawa mshenji mwa Lebanoni kulawa Baaligadi muluseleru lwa lugongu Herimoni mpaka Lebohamati, <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />na enewu lya migongu yaiwera pakati pa Lebanoni na Misirefotimaimu lilii wenikaya wakuwi ndo Wasidoni. Waisraeli ntambu yawendereya kugenda kulongolu, neni namweni hanuwawingi wantu wa isi azi kulongolu kwawu. Nagwenga haguwagawili Waisraeli semu za isi azi kwa kugalambula simbi ntambu yanikulagaliriti. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Haguzibaguliri isi azi makabila tisa, pamuhera na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi, makabila galii hagenipati shintu.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabagulanu ga kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi pamuhera na nusu imonga ya likabila lya Manasi, gapananitwi isi yaiwera kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa ntumintumi gwakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Enewu lyawu liweriti kwanjira Aroeri muukingu mwa lularanda lwa Arinoni na mji yaguwera pakati pa lularanda na isi ilii yoseri ya laranda kwanjira Medeba mpaka Diboni, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />pamuhera na miji yoseri ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori, yakakolitimlima aku Heshiboni mpaka mumbaka mwa Waamoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />pamuhera na isi za Gileadi enewu lya Wageshuri na Wamakati, lugongu lwa Herimoni na isi yoseri ya Bashani mpaka Saleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />na ufalumi woseri wa Ogu yumu gwa Warefayi yawasigaliti, mweni kakolitimlima aku Ashitaroti na Edireyi Mubashani. Musa kaweriti kawakanka woseri walii na kuitola isi yawu. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Pamuhera na hangu Waisraeli wawawingiti ndiri Wageshuri na Wamaaka kumbiti walikaliti muwamu mwa Waisraeli mpaka leru.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Musa kawapananiti ndiri nakamu enewu wantu wa likabila lya Lawi. Kumbiti tambiku zyawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli kwa kulunguziya motu, tambiku azi ziweriti lifungu lyawu, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yakapananitwi Rubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Semu ya isi ilii Musa yakawapananiti wantu wa likabila lya Rubeni kulinganira na kolu zawu, <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Iweriti kwanjira Aroeri mbwega ya lularanda lwa Arinoni pamuhera na mji yaguweriti mulularanda alu pamuhera na miji yakuwi yoseri na isi yayahera migongu ya Medeba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Iweriti viraa pamuhera na Heshiboni na miji yakuwi yoseri yaiwera yahera migongu. Yeni ndo Diboni Bamotibaali na Betibaalimeoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Na Yahasa na Kedemoti na Mefaati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriataimu na Sibima na Seretisahari, aku kushidunda sha lularanda, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />na Betipeori na mumiseleru za lugongu Pisiga na Betiyeshimoti <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />na miji yoseri yayahera migongu, isi yoseri ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori yakakolitimlima aku Heshiboni. Musa kamkankiti mfalumi ayu Sihoni na walongoziya wa Midiyani na Evi na Rekemu na Suri na Huri na Reba ulii yakakolitimlima semu ya isi badala ya mfalumi Sihoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Mukwongera kwa walii yawahowiti munkondu, shonta lya Israeli limlagiti Balaam yakaweriti mtunga, yomberi kaweriti mwana gwa Beori. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Mbaka ya isi ya likabila lya Rubeni uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji iweriti lushemba Yoridani. Miji na maenewu yagakantitwi panu iweriti semu yawapananitwi wantu wa nkolu za likabila lya Rubeni.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yakapananitwi Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Semu ya isi ilii Musa yakawapananiti wantu wa likabila lya Gadi kulingalira na nkolu zawu, <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />iweriti Yazeri na miji yoseri ya Gileadi na nusu ya isi ya Waamoni mpaka Aroeri yaiwera pakwegera na mji gwa Raba. <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />Viraa virii kwanjira Heshiboni mpaka Ramati mizipa, Betonimu na kulawa Mahanaimu mbaka ya Debiri. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Viraa miji yaiweriti mulularanda lwa Betiharamu na Betinimra na Sukoti na Zafoni na isi yaisigaliti ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Heshiboni. Mbaka yawu uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji guweriti lushemba Yoridani gusoka mpaka litanda Galilaya. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Miji na vijiji avi ndo vyawapananitwi wantu wa likabila lya Gadi kulinganira na nkolu zawu.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Kayi Musa kaweriti kalipananiti nusu ya likabila lya Manasi kulinganira na nkolu zawu, <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />enewu la isi kwanjira Mahanaimu mpaka kwingira muisi yoseri yaiweriti ya mfalumi Ogu aku Bashani, pamuhera na miji malongu sita ya Yairi. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Na nusu ya Gileyadi na Ashitaloti na Edireyi yaikolitwimlima na mfalumi Ogu gwa aku Bashani. Kulinganira na nkolu zawu enewu ali wapananitwi nusu ya wiwuka wa Makiri mwana gwa Manasi.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Musa kawabaguliriti semu azi za isi zyaziweriti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yeriku na Yoridani, pakaweriti kularanda za Mowabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Kumbiti Musa kalipananiti ndiri likabila lya Walawi semu yawu ya isi, toziya kawagambiriti kuwera semu yawu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Kubaguluwa kwa isi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Aga ndo maenewu ga isi ilii yawapananitwi Waisraeli muisi ya Kanaani. Mtambika Eliyazari pamuhera na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, pamuhera na wakulu wa nkolu za makabila ga Waisraeli wawabaguliriti Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Isi yawu ayi wabaguluwitwi kwa kugalambula simbi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa kuwera kagapanani makabila tisa na nusu. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Musa kagapananiti makabila galii mawili na nusu ya isi yawu kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani, kumbiti Walawi waweriti ndiri wapananwa semu yawu pamuhera na womberi <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Wiwuka wa Yosefu waweriti makabila mawili. Manasi na Efureimu. Likabila lya Lawi lipananituwiti ndiri seemu yoseri ya isi, ila miji hera ya kulikala na semu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu kwajili ya wankanyama wawu. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Su Waisraeli waibagula isi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagariti Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Karebu kankupananuwa mji gwa Hebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Lishaka limu wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wamgenderiti Yoshuwa aku Giligali. Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni, mweni kaweriti muntu gwa Kenizi, kamgambiriti Yoshuwa, “Nakaka gulihola Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Musa, muntu gwa Mlungu kuusu neni pamuhera na gwenga patuweriti Kadeshi barineya. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Paweriti na umuli gwa vinja alubaini, Musa ntumintumi gwa Mlungu, kandagaliriti kulawa Kadeshi barineya kugenda kuyilolalola isi. Pambuyiti nimjegeriti visoweru vya vitwatira vya aku kulawirana ntambu yanjimiriti mumoyu mwangu. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Kumbiti walii yawagenditi pamuhera na neni wawatenditi wantu waweri na lyoga, ila neni nimjimiriti Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu kwa uwaminika. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Lishaka ali Musa kanapilira, nakaka semu ya isi ilii yagupipiti hayiweri ya gwenga na wiwuka waku mashaka goseri. Toziya ya waminika waku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu. <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Kumbiti vinu guloli! Ndo shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi na muhanu kwanjira Mtuwa Mlungu pakayoweriti na Musa, Waisraeli pawaweriti wankupita kushiwala. Kwanjira shaka ashi Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti, kantula mkomu mpaka leru na vinu neni nana umuli wa vinja semanini na mhanu <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Kumbiti nankali na likakala ntambu yaweriti shaka shilii Musa pakanagaliriti. Ata vinu wera na makakala ga kuweza kulikomana nkondu ama kutenda shintu shoseri shilii. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Vinu nduwa gumpanani neni isi ayi ya migongu Mtuwa Mlungu yakanagaliti lishaka lilii. Gwenga gupikaniriti lishaka lilii kuwera Waanaki walikaliti amu mumiji yaiwera na boma, pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu hakaweri pamuhera na neni, na neni hanuwawingi womberi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti.” <verse eid="JOS 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kamtekeleriti Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni na kampananiti mji gwa Hebroni kuwera uhala wakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Su mji gwa Hebroni guwera semu yawu wiwuka wa Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni muntu gwa Kenizi mpaka leru, toziya Karebu kaweriti kamfata Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli kwa moyu gwakuwi goseri. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Mji gwa Hebroni mashaka gapititi gushemituwiti Kiriyatiariba. Ariba kaweriti muntu kamanikana kuliku woseri pakati pa Waanaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Isi yoseri iweriti na ponga.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Isi yawapananitwi wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Enewu lya isi yawapananwitwi kwa kugalambula simbi wantu wa likabila lya Yuda kulinganira na wantu wakuwi lieneyiti kwanjira kusika kwagulawa mshenji mpaka mumbaka mwa Edomu. Semu ya kusika nakamu iweriti shiwala sha Sini. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Mbaka yawu iyanjiti mupembi ya kusika mwa bahari ya Munu, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />yendereyiti kusika mpaka shidunda sha Akirabimu, ipitira mbwega ya Sini na kusika ya Kadeshibarineya, ipitira Hesironi mpaka Adari na shakapanu igalambuka kugenda Karika. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Kulawa panu ipitiliti pakwegera na Asimoni na kufata lushemba lwa Misri mpaka kusoka kubahali ya Mediteraniyani. Panu ndo payipititi mbaka ya kusika mwa Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Mbaka yawu ya uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji ndo bahari ya Munu mpaka palii lushemba Yoridani palwingilira kubahali. Na mbaka yawu uwega wa kushana ipititi kulawa uwega wa bahari ya Munu pahala palii lushemba Yoridani lwingilira kubahali. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Mbaka ayi ipititi Betihogila na kushana mwa Betiaraba mpaka kulitalawu lya Bohani yakaweriti mwana gwa Rubeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kulawa palii, iyendereyiti mpaka Debiri kulularanda lwa Akori na kushana kugenda Giligali yaiwera pakwegera na shidunda sha Adumimu yashiwera kusika mwa lushemba, shakapanu igenda kumbwiru za Enishemeshi na kupelera Enirogeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Shakapanu mbaka ayi ipitiriti kulularanda lwa Hinomu, uwega wa kusika mwa shigongu sha Wayebusi, ndo Yerusalemu, kugenda kulupeleru lwa lugongu lwaluwera kwaguzyeta mshenji lwa lularanda lwa Hinomu na kusoka upeleru wa lularanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kulawa palii, igenditi kulugongu mpaka mbwiru za Nefitowa mpaka kumiji ya lugongu lwa Efroni. Panu mbaka igalambukiti Baala, kweni Kiriyatiyearimu, <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />kweni ipinditi kwaguzyeta mshenji kugenda lugongu Seiri, ipita kushana mwa lugongu lwa Yerimu, aku Kesaloni na kuselera mpaka Betishemeshi kulii ipititi pakwegera na Timuna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Shakapanu iyendereya uwega wa kushana mwa Ekroni, izyengeta kugenda Shikironi kulii ipititi pakwegera na lugongu Baali mpaka Yabineeli ipelera mubahari ya Mediteraniyani. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Mbaka ya kuguzyetera mshenji iweriti bahari ya Mediteraniyani. Ndo iweriti mbaka ya enewu lyawapananitwi wantu wa likabila lya Yuda kulinganira na kolu zawu.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Karebu wankukolamlima enewu lya Hebroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Karebu mwana gwa Yefune, kapananitwi semu ya isi ya Yuda gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Yoshuwa. Kapananuwiti mji gwa Ariba gulii mweni kaweriti mbuyi gwa Anaki. Mji agu vinu gushemuwa Hebroni. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Karebu kaviwingiti viyiwuku vya Anaki vyeni ndo nkolu ya Sheshayi na ya Ahimani na ya Talimai. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kulawa Hebroni kagenditi kuwakomanga nkondu wenikaya wa Debiri, mji gulii mashaka gapititi gushemitwi Kiriatiseferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Karebu kabwera handa, “Hakamyugiziyi muhinga gwakuwi Akisa kwa mpalu yoseri yakagutola kwa makakala mji gwa Kiriatiseferi.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Su Otinieli mwana gwa Kenazi mlongu gwakuwi Karebu, kagutoliti kwa makakala mji agu, na Karebu kamyugiziya muhinga gwakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Mulishaka lyawu lya ndowa, Akisa kamgambiriti Otinieli kamluwi Karebu lirambu. Akisa kaweriti pampindi pa punda na pakaweriti kankuselera pasi, Karebu kamkosiya, “Gufira nikupanani shishi?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa kamwankula, “Gumpanani neni lifupu, semu yaiwera na mashi toziya aku Negebu kwagunupiti ndo kuyuma.” Su Karebu kampanana mbwiru za mashi zyaziweriti semu za pampindi na za pasi.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Awu ndo uhala wa wantu wa likabila lya Yuda kulinganira na kolu zawu. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Miji yaiweriti uwega wa kusika nakamu mwa isi ya Yuda kugenda mbaka ya Edomu iweriti Kabiseeli na Ederi na Yagari, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />na Kina na Dimona na Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />na Kedeshi na Hazori na Itinani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />na Zifu na Telemu na Bealoti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />na Hazori hadata na Kerioti hezironi ndo imanikana Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amamu na Shema na Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />na Hasarigada na Heshimoni na Biti peleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hasari shuali na Beeri sheba na Biziotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />na Baala na Iyumu na Ezemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />na Elitoladi na Kesili na Horima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />na Sikilagi na Madimana na Sansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebaoti na Shilihimu na Aini na Rimoni. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti malongu mawili na tisa pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Miji yaiweriti kulularanda iweriti Eshitaoli na Sora na Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanowa na Enganimu na Tapuwa na Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />na Yarimuti na Adulamu na Soko na Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />na Shaaraimu na Aditaimu na Gedera na Gederotaimu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti lilongu na msheshi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Womberi viraa wapananuwituwiti viraa miji ya Senani na Hadasha na Migidal gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />na Dileyani na Mizipa na Yokiteeli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />na Lakishi na Bosikati na Egiloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />na Kaboni na Lahimamu na Kitilishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />na Gederoti na Betidagoni na Naama na Makeda. Walanga ya miji yawapaniwitwi iweriti lilongu na sita pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Kayi wapananitwi miji ya Libina na Eteri na Ashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />na Yifita na Ashina na Nezibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />na Keila na Akizibu na Maresha. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti tisa pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Viraa virii wapananitwi Ekroni pamuhera na miji yakuwi mididini na vijiji, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />miji yoseri na vijiji vyaviweriti pakwegera na Ashidodi pakati pa Ekroni na bahari, <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Ashidodi na Gaza pamuhera na miji na vijiji vyakuwi, mpaka lushemba lwa Misri mpaka mbwega ya bahari ya Mediteraniyani.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Miji iweriti kuenewu lya kulugongu iweriti Shamiri na Yatiri na Soku, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana na Kiriyatisana ndo yaimanika Deberi, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anabu na Eshitemowa na Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gosheni na Holoni na Gilo. Walanga ya miji yawapananuwituwiti iweriti lilongu na yimu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Viraa womberi wapananitwi miji ya Arabu na Duma na Eshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />na Yanimu na Betitapua na Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />na Humta na Kiritiariba ndo yaimanika Hebroni, na Siori. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti tisa pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Viraa wapananuwituwiti miji ya Maoni na Karimeli na Zifu na Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />na Yezireeli na Yokideamu na Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />na Kaini na Gibea na Timuna. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti lilongu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Viraa virii miji ya Halihuli na Betisuri na Gedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />na Maarati na Betianoti na Elitekoni. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti sita pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Ntambu iraa wapananitwi Kiriyatibaali na Raba. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti miwili pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Miji ya kushiwala iweriti Betiaraba na Midini na Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />na Nibishani, mji gwa Munu na Engedi. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti sita pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Kumbiti wantu wa Yuda wasinditi kuwawinga Wayebusi, walii yawaweriti wenikaya wa Yerusalemu na mpaka leru Wayebusi wankali wankulikala kumjini amu pamuhera na wantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Isi ya Efureyimu na isi ya Manasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Isi yawabagulilitwi wiwuka wa Yosefu kwa kugalambula simbi yanjiti pakwegera na lushemba Yoridani, kwagulawa mshenji mwa mbwiru ya Yeriku na kupitira kushiwala, mpaka kusemu za lugongu mpaka Beteli. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Kulawa Beteli igenditi Luzu ipita Atoroti kulii kwawalikaliti Waariki. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Shakapanu isuluka kwaguzyeta mshenji muisi ya Wayafileti mpaka Betihoroni ya pasi na Gezeri na kupelera kubahali ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Wiwuka wa Yosefu, ndo likabila lya Manasi na likabila lya Efureimu, wapananitwi isi iweri uhala wawu.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Efurayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Wantu wa Likabila lya Efurayimu kulinganira na lukolu lwawu wapatiti semu yaiwera mbaka yawu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji ipititi Ataroti adari mpaka Beti horoni ya pampindi, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />na kupelera bahari ya Mediteraniyani. Kwa uwega wa kushana mbaka ipititi Mikimetati na uwega kwagulawa mshenji guzyengeta na kugendera Taanati shilu mpaka Yanowa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Kulawa Yanowa igenditi mpaka Ataroti na Naara, mpaka kusoka Yeriku, kulii ipeleriti mulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kulawa Tapuwa, mbaka igenditi kwaguzyeta mshenji mpaka lushemba lwa Kana na kupelera bahari ya Mediteraniyani. Ayi ndo isi yawapananitwi wantu wa likabila lya Efureimu kulinganira na nkolu zawu, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />pamuhera na miji na vijiji virii wongelelitwi kulawa kuisi ya likabila lya Manasi. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Waefurayimu wawawingiti ndiri Wakanaani yawalikaliti Gezeri. Wakanaani awa wendereyiti kulikala muwamu mwa wantu wa Efurayimu mpaka leru, pawawera wamanda wa kuwatendeziya mahengu ga kukakanika.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Nusu imonga yawapananitwi Manasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Wantu wa likabila lya Manasi kaweriti mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Yosefu, viraa wapananuwitwi enewu lyawu kwa kugalambula simbi. Makiri mwiwuka gwa kwanja gwa Manasi yakawera tati gwa Gileadi wapananuwitwi kala miji ya Gileadi na Bashani kaweriti shonta mgangamala. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Wamonga yawasigaliti wa likabila lya Manasi wapananitwi semu yawu kwa kugalambula simbi kulinganira na nkolu zawu. Nkolu azi ziweriti zilii za Abiezeri na Heleki na Asirieli na Shekemu na Heferi na Shemida, woseri awa waweriti wiwuka wapalu wa Manasi mwana gwa Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Kumbiti Selofehadi mwana gwa Heferi na Heferi kaweriti mwana gwa Gileyadi, Gileyadi kaweriti mwana gwa Makiri na Makiri kaweriti mwana gwa Manasi yakaweriti ndiri na wana wapalu, kumbiti kaweriti na wana wadala.Womberi waweriti Mahila na Nowa na Hogila na Milika na Tiriza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Wahinga awa wamwizira mtambika Eliyazari na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nuni na walonguziya wamonga wawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa katubaguliri na twenga twawoseri isi ntambu yawabaguluwa walongu wetu wapalu.” Su kugenderana na malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Yoshuwa kawapananiti semu yawu ntambu yakawapananiti wapalu wa likabila lyawu. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Su likabila lya Manasi lipananitwi semu lilongu lya isi na wawongeruwa isi ya Gileyadi na Bashani yaiwera uwega umonga wa lushemba Yoridani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />toziya wahinga wa Manasi wabaguluwitwi semu zawu ntambu yawabaguluwitwi walongu wawu wapalu. Isi ya Gileyadi wapananitwi wiwuka wamonga wa Manasi. <verse eid="JOS 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Enewu lya likabila lya Manasi lyanjiliti Asheri na kugenda mpaka Mikimetati kwagulawa mshenji mwa Shekemu, shakapanu mbaka yawu iendereya kusika mpaka kuisi ya wenikaya wa Enitapuwa. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Isi ya Tapua iweriti uhala wakuwi likabila lya Manasi, kumbiti mji gwa Tapua, gulii guweriti mumbaka guweriti uhala wa wiwuka wa Efurayimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Mbaka ayi yendereyiti mpaka shishemba sha Kana. Miji yaiweriti kusika ya Kana iweriti ya Waefurayimu tembera iweriti muisi ya likabila lya Manasi. Shakapanu mbaka ya Manasi ipititi kushana mwa lushemba Kana na kupelera bahari ya Mediteraniyani.<verse eid="JOS 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Isi ya kusika liweriti lya likabila lya Efurayimu na enewu lya kushana liweriti lya likabila lya Manasi, mbaka yakuwi iweriti bahari ya Mediteraniyani uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji. Likabila lya Asheri liweriti kushana kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa enewu lya Manasi na kushana kwagulawa mshenji liweriti likabila lya Isakari.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Viraa virii muisi ya likabila lya Isakari na likabila lya Asheri, likabila lya Manasi lipananitwi miji ya Beti sheani na Ibileyamu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi, na miji ya Dori na En dori na Taanaki na Megidu pamuhera na wenikaya na vijiji vyakuwi na selusi ya Nafutahi. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Kumbiti wawuka wa Manasi waweziti ndiri kuwawinga wenikaya wa miji ayi, hangu Wakanaani wendereyiti kulikala amu, <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />tembera ata pa Waisraeli kuwera na makakala nentu, waweza ndiri kuwawinga Wakanaani kumbiti wawatendeziyiti mahengu ga kuwakakanika. <verse eid="JOS 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Wantu wa likabila lya Yosefu wamgenderiti Yoshuwa, wamgambiriti, “Iwera hashi gutubagulira semu yimu hera ya isi iweri uhala wetu? Twenga tuwera wavuwa nentu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu katutekeleriti.” <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yoshuwa kawankula, “Handa mwenga muwera wavuwa hangu, ata isi ya vigongu vya Efurayimu viwatosha ndiri kayi, su mgendi kulidowi muisi ya Waperizi na ya Warefai, mwakalihengi lidowi na kulikali aku.” <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Na womberi wamwankula, “Nakaka handa isi ayi ya vigongu itutosheya ndiri, ata hangu Wakanaani woseri walii yawalikala kulularanda wawera na mbutuka za shuma zyazikwegwa na farasi, viraa walii woseri yawalikala Betisheani pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi na walii yawalikala kulularanda lwa Yezireeli.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Su Yoshuwa kawagambira likabila lya Yosefu, ali ndo likabila lya Efurayimu na Manasi, “Nakaka mwenga muwera wavuwa nentu na muwera na makakala nentu. Ifaa ndiri mpati semu yimu hera, <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />kumbiti viraa isi ya vigongu hayiweri yenu. Tembera vinu iwera lidowi, hamulihengi na kuikolamlima yoseri kulawa uwega awu mpaka uwega umonga. Hamuwawusiyi Wakanaani, ata pawawera na mbutuka za shuma zyazikwegwa na farasi na ata pawawera na makakala.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gamonga gakubaguluwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Pa kuyikanka isi ilii, shipinga shoseri sha Israeli shijojonikiti aku Shilo na kulibawira liringu linanagala. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Kulii gasigaliti makabila saba ga Waisraeli gawapananitwi ndiri isi kuwera uhala wawu.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Su Yoshuwa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, “Hashi, hamkawi mpaka ndii kugenda kuyikolamlima isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wenu kawapanana? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Msyaguli wantu watatu kulawa mukila likabila niwalagaliri muisi yoseri wailoliloli na kulemba lamani kulinganira na makabila gawu, shakapanu wanjegeri shawawoniti. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Na womberi hawayibagulangi isi ayi semu saba. Likabila lya Yuda halisigali na semu yakuwi ya kusika na likabila lya Yosefu kushana. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Mlembi weri kuusu semu zoseri saba na kunjegera. Shakapanu hang'alambuli simbi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu, kuusu semu ya kila likabila lyenu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Kumbiti Walawi hapeni wapati semu yoseri pakati penu, toziya semu yawu hayiweri watambika wa kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu. Gadi na Rubeni pamuhera na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi wapatiti kala semu yawu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. Wapananituwiti semu ilii na Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="JOS 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Su wantu awa wanjiti mwanja gwa kugenda kuilolalola isi. Pamberi pa kugenda, Yoshuwa kawalagaliriti pakawagambira, “Mgendi kuisi koseri mwakalembi weri visoweru kuusu isi ilii, shakapanu muwuyi mung'ambiri, shakapanu hang'alambuli simbi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu palaa panu Shilo kuusu semu yamgenda kupananwa.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Wantu walii wawukiti na kugenda kuisi ilii yoseri. Walembiti weri visoweri kuusu semu zilii saba pamuhera na miji yakuwi, shakapanu wawuyiti kwa Yoshuwa kumalingu kulii Shilo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kazigalambuziyiti simbi aku Shilo kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu semu zilii, su kawabaguliriti Waisraeli, kila likabila ipatiti semu yakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Benjamini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Simbi ya kwanja ipatiti likabila lya Benjamini kulinganira na nkolu zakuwi. Enewu lyawapananitwi wantu awa liweriti pakati pa likabila lya Yuda na lilii lya likabila lya Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Mbaka yakuwi ya kushana iyanjiti lushemba Yoridani na kupitira kushana mwa Yeriku na isi ya vigongu paigenda kwaguzyeta mshenji mpaka kushidowi sha Beti yaveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kulawa aku, mbaka yakuwi igenditi kusika kugenda Luzu kupitira uwega wa kusika mwa Luzu, Luzu imanikana handa Beteli, su igenditi mpaka Ataroti yadari, kulugongu lwaluwera kusika mwa Beti horoni ya pasi. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Mbaka yawu ya kwaguzyetera mshenji ndo kulawa kushigongu shashilolana na Beti holoni kwa uwega wa kusika mbaka igalambukiti payipita kumbwega mwa isi ya Wabenjamini na kusoka Kiliati baali agu ndo Kiliati jearimu yaguweriti mji gwa wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Uwega wa kusika mbaka yakuwi iyanjiti uwega wa upeleru wa mji gwa Kiriyatiyearimu, isoka Efroni na kugenda mpaka kumbwiru ya mashi ya Nefutowa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Shakapanu igenditi pasi kupitira kumbeku mwa lugongu lwaluwera pakwegera na lularanda lwa Hinomu, lilii lyaliweriti musemu ya kushana nentu ya lularanda lwa Warefayi. Kayi mbaka iseleriti lularanda lwa Hinomu, kusika mwa lugongu lwa Wayebusi, yendeleya kuselelera mpaka Enirogeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Aku mbaka igalambukira kugenda kushana kugenda Enishemeshi, ipitira Gililoti pakwegera pashidunda sha Adumimu kuselelera mpaka kulibuwi lya Bohani mwana gwa Rubeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Kulawa palii mbaka izyengetiti kushana muunenemu mwa pampindi pa Araba na kupelera aku Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Kayi yendeleyiti uwega wa kushana mwa lugongu lwa Betihogila na kupelera kushana mwa Bahari ya Munu, pahala palwingilira lushemba Yoridani. Ayi ndo mbaka yakuwi kwa uwega wa kusika. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Lushemba Yoridani ndo lyaluweriti mbaka yakuwi uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji. Ndo zyazituluwitwi mbaka za isi zyazipananuwitwi nkolu za likabila lya Benjamini.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Miji ya nkolu za likabila lya Benjamini ndo Yeriku na Betihogila na Emekikesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />na Betiaraba na Zemaraimu na Beteri, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />na Avimu na Para na Ofura, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />na Kefaraamoni na Ofini na Geba. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti lilongu na mbili pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Miji yamonga iweriti Gibeoni na Rama na Beeroti, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />na Mizipa na Kefira na Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />na Rekemu na Iripeeli na Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />na Zela na Haelefu na Yebusi gushemuwa viraa Yerusalemu na Gibea na Kiriatiyearimu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi iweriti lilongu na msheshi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. Yoseri ayi ndo seemu yawapananitwi wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini na nkolu zawu.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Isi yawapanuwitwi likabila lya Simioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Simbi ya pili ipatiti nkolu za likabila lya Simoni na semu yawu ya isi iweriti izyengetwa na ilii ya likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Likabila lya Simoni lipatiti miji ya Beeri Sheba, Sheba na Molada <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hasarishuali na Bala na Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Elitoladi na Betuli na Horima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Sikilagi na Beti marikaboti na Hasari susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Betilebaoti na Sharuheni. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na mitatu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Viraa kuweriti na miji ya Aini na rimoni na Eteri na Ashani. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Pamuhera na vijiji vyoseri vyavizyengetiti miji ayi mpaka Baalatibeeri, ama Rama ya Negebu. Zoseri azi ndo seemu yazipananitwi nkolu za likabila lya Simoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Toziya enewu lyalipananitwi likabila lya Yuda liweriti likulu kuliku likabila ali ntambu yalifiriti, seemu ya enewu lyakuyi lipananitwi likabila lya Simoni.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yawapananitwi likabila lya Zebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Simbi ya tatu izipatiti likabila lya Zebuloni. Enewu lawu lieneyiti mpaka Saridi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Kulawa aku mbaka yakuwi igenditi kwaguzyeta mshenji mpaka Mareali, ipita kumpeku mwa Dabesheti na kugenda kulushemba lwaluwera kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yokineamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Kulawa Saridi, mbaka ayi igenditi kwagulawa mshenji mpaka kumbaka ya Kisilotitabori na kulawa aku ipita Daberati mpaka Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Kulawa Yafia igenditi kwagulawa mshenji mpaka Gati heferi na Etikasini na kwendeleya mpaka Rimoni aku ikweniti kugenda neya. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Uwega wa kushana mbaka igalambukira kugenda Hanatoni na kupelera kulularanda lwa Yifitaheli. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Gongelera Miji ya Katati na Nahalali na Shimroni na Yidala na Beti lehemu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na miwili pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Ayi ndo semu yazipananitwi nkolu za likabila lya Zebuloni miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Isakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Simbi ya msheshi izipatiti kolu za likabila lya Isakari. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Enewu lilii liweriti na miji ya Yezireeli na Kesuloti na Shunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafaraimu na Shioni na Anaharati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabiti na kishioni na Ebesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remeti na Eniganimu na Enihada na Betipasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Ntambu iraa, mbaka yawu isokiti Tabori na Shahasuma, na Beti shemeshi kupelera lushemba Yoridani. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na sita pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Azi ndo semu yazipananuwitwi nkolu za likabila lya Isakari, miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Asheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Simbi ya mhanu izipatiti nkolu za likabila lya Asheri. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Enewu lya isi yawu iweriti na miji ya Helikati na Hali na beteni na Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alameleki na Amadi na Mishali. Kwa Uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mpaka gushing'ulaniti na lugongu Karimeri na Shihori libinati. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Shakapanu igalambuka kugenda kwagulawa mshenji Beti Dagoni kweni ishinkulana na Zeburoni na lularanda lwa Ifutaheli. Shakapanu iendereya kushana mpaka Beti emeki na Neieli mpaka Kabuli, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Ebuloni na Rehobu na Hamoni na Kana mpaka Sidoni mkulu. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Panu, mbaka igalambukiriti kugenda Rama na kusoka kumji gwa Tiro yaguweriti na liboma. Shakapanu igalambukira kugenda Hosa na kupelera kubahali ya Medeteraniya. Miji imonga yaiweriti ndo Maharabu na Akizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uma Afeka na Rehobu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na miwili pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Seemu azi ndo zipananitwi kolu za likabila lya Asheri, miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Simbi ya sita izipatiti Kolu za likabila lya Nafutali. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Mbaka yakuwi iyanjiliti Helefu na mwaloni gwa Zaananimu, ipita Adaminekebu na Yabineeli mpaka Lakumu na kupelera kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Kulawa panu mbaka igenditi kwaguzyeta mshenji kugenda Azinoti tabori, kulawa aku igenda Hukoki na kushinkulana na pembi ya kusika ya enewu lya likabila lya Zebuloni, shakapanu na enewu lya likabila lya Asheri uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji na kushinkulana na enewu lya Yuda. Kwa uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mbaka iyingira kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Miji yawu iweriti na liboma ndo Zidimu na Zeri na Hamati na Rakati na Kinereti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama na Rama na Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kadeshi na Edirei na Eni hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yironi na Migida leli na Horemu na Beti anati na Beti shemeshi. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na tisa pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Azi ndo semu zipananuwitwi nkolu za likabila lya Nafutali, miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Simbi ya saba izipatiti nkolu za likabila lya Dani. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Enewu lya isi yawu iweriti na miji ya Sora na Eshitaoli na Iri shemesi <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Shaalabini na Aiyaloni na Yitila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Eloni na Timuna na Ekroni <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Eliteki na Gibetoni na Baalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehudi na Beneberaki na Gatirimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Meyarikoni na Rakoni na isi yaiweriti pakwegera na Yopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Wantu wa likabila lya Dani iweriti vikammala kwa womberi kuyitola isi yawapananitwi, hangu wagalambukiti na wagenditi na kugukomanga mji gwa Leshemu. Wagukankiti na kugutola kwa makakala, na pa kuwalaga wenikaya wakuwi woseri, wagukolitimlima shapanu wagalambula litawu lya mji agu kuwera Dani, litawu ali liweriti ndo lya mbuyi gwawu. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Azi ndo semu yazipananitwi nkolu za likabila lya Dani, miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubagulanga wa Upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Pawamaliriti kubagulana semu zoseri za isi, Waisraeli wampananiti Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nuni, semu yakuwi pakati pawu. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Kulinganira na amuri ya Mtuwa Mlungu wampananiti mji gulii gwakagusyaguliti mweni, gweni Timinatisera, agu guweriti muisi ya vigongu vya Efraimu. Na Yoshuwa kagunyawiti kwa syayi mji agu na kulikala amu.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Su, Mtambika Eleazari na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Nuni, pamuhera na walongoziya wa makabila ga Waisraeli wabaguliti semu azi kwa kugalambura simbi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu paligomi lya liringu lya kuliwona aku Shilu. Su wamalira kuyibagula isi.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutugila kuponera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Yoshuwa, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />Guwagambiri Waisraeli, “mtuli gweka miji ya kutugira kuponera, ntambu yanukulagaliriti kupitira Musa, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Muntu yoseri pakamlaga muntu pota kukusudiya kaweza kutugira kumji gumu gwawu na hangu kumshapira muntu ulii yakawera na lihengu lya kuwuzilira kwa kulaga. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Muntu yakalaga katugiri kumji gumu gwawu na kugoloka paligomi lya mji na kuwagambira wazewi wa mji agu lishitaka lyakuyi. Wazewi hawamwingiziyi mngati na kumpanana pahala pa kulikala pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Uli yakamwuzilira pakamgendera mpaka kumjini, wazewi wa mji agu wajimiruwa ndiri kumlaviya mlaga ayu kwa yakawuzilira, toziya kamlagiti myaguwi kwa kufira ndiri, kwaniti unkondu ndiri pakati pawu shaka shipititi. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Mlaga hakendereyi kulikala amu mpaka palii pakatozwi kulongolu kushipinga shoseri sha Israeli na viraa mpaka palii mtambika mkulu ulii yakaweriti na ukulu shaka ashi pakahowa. Pa panu muntu ayu hakawezi kuwuya ukaya kwakuwi kumji gulii gwakatololikiti.” <verse eid="JOS 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Su, toziya ayi wayitula gweka miji ya Kadeshi Mugalilaya kumigongu ya Nafutali, Shekemu mumigongu ya Efureimu na Kiriati Ariba ndo Hebuloni muisi ya migongu ya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Kumwambu mwa lushemba Yoridani, kwagulawa mshenji mwa mji gwa Yeriku, watuliti mji gwa Bezeri yaguweriti kushiwala lularanda na mji agu ndo gwa likabila lya Rubeni. Viraa watuliti Ramoti aku Gileadi agu ndo mji gwa likabila lya Gadi na Golani aku Bashani muenewu lya likabila lya Manasi. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Ayi ndo miji yaitulitwi gweka kwajili ya wantu woseri wa Israeli na wahenga yawalikaliti muwamu mwawu, su muntu yoseri yakamlaga myaguwi pota kukusudiya katugiri aku nakiza kulaguwa na yakana utoza wa kuwuzilira kwa kulaga, mpaka palii hakatozwi kulongolu kwa shipinga shoseri.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Miji ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Pawaweriti aku Shilu muisi ya Kanaani walongoziya wa kolu za Walawi wawagendera mtambika Eleazari na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni na walonguziya wa wantu wa makabila goseri ga Waisraeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />wawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagiliriti Musa tupananwi miji ya kulikala na ntundu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu za wakanyama wetu.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu, kawalagaliriti Waisraeli wawapanani Walawi, miji yayifata na ntundu kunja kwa miji yawu yawapananitwi.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Simbi ya kwanja wazipatiti wantu wa lukolu lwa Kohati. Na Walawi yawaweriti wiwuka wa mtambika Aruni wapananitwi kwa kugalambula simbi, miji yayiweriti muenewu lya makabila ga Yuda na Simoni na Benjamini. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo lilongu na mitatu.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Kohati yawasigaliti wapananitwi miji lilongu yaiweriti muenewu lya makabila ga Efraimu na Dani na muenewu lya nusu ya likabila lya Manasi.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Gerishoni wapananitwi kwa kugalambula simbi miji lilongu na mitatu muenewu lya makabila ga Isakari na Asheri na Nafutari na muenewu lya nusu ya likabila lya Manasi aku Bashani.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Kaya za lukolu lwa Merari wapananitwi miji malongu na miwili muenewu lya makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na Zebuloni.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Waisraeli wawapanana Walawi miji ayi pamuhera na vijiji vya maliwuziwu ga mifugu gawu ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu vyakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Aga ndo matawu ga miji kulawa kuenewu lya likabila lya Yuda na Simioni, <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />kwa wiwuka wa mtambika Aruni, waweriti kaya za lukolu lwa Kohati mweni kaweriti gwa likabila lya Lawi. Seemu yawu wapatiti kwanja toziya simbi yawu ilawiriti kwanja. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Wapananitwi Kiriati ariba yeni ndo Hebuloni, na izyengetitwi ndundu ya maliwuziwu ga mifugu, mulugongu lwa isi ya Yuda. Araba kawerit tati gwa Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Kumbiti malambu ga mji agu pamuhera na vijiji vyavizyengetiti kaweriti kala kapanunwa Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni viweri vyakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Tembera ya kuwapanana wiwuka wa mtambika Aruni mji gwa Hebuloni gweni viraa guweriti gutuluwa gweka kuwera mji gwa kutugira, viraa wawapananitwi mji gwa Libina pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yatira pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Eshitemoa pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holoni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Debiri pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Aini pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Yuta pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Beti shemeshi pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga ya miji ayi yaiwera muenewu lya makabila mawili aga ndo tisa. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Muenewu lya likabila lya Benjamini wapananuwitwi miji imonga. Gibeoni na Geba. <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatoti na Alimoni, miji ayi yoseri iweriti na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Miji yoseri ya wiwuka wa Aruni weni waweriti watambika, iweriti lilongu na mitatu pamuhera na ndundu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Wantu yawasigaliti wa lukolu lwa Kohati, weni viraa ndo kaya za likabila lya Lawi wapananitwi miji muenewu lya likabila lya Efraimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Wapananitwi Shekemu, mji gulii yaguweriti viraa mji gwa kutugira, pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu muisi ya migongu ya Efraimu na Gezeri pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibizaimu pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Beti horoni pamuhera na ntundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi, <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Mulienewu lya likabila lya Dani wapananitwi Eliteke pamuhera na ndudndu zyakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Gibetoni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Aiyaloni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Gati Rimoni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Mulienewu lya nusu ya likabila lya Manasi wapananitwi Taanaki pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Gati Rimoni pamuhera na maliwuziu gakuyi. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo miwili. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Su, miji yeni wapananitwi kaya za Kohati yazisigaliti ziweriti lilongu yimu na ndundu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Kaya za Walawi za lukolu lwa Gerishoni, wapananitwi miji miwili munusu ya enewu lya likabila lya Manasi. Golani aku Bashani, mji gwa kutugira, pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Beeshi Tera pamuhera na maliwuziwu ga mifugu gakuyi. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Mulienewu lya likabila lya Isakari, wapananitwi Kishioni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Daberati pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yarimuti pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Eni ganimu pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Muenewu lya likabila lya Asheri wapananitwi Mishali pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Abudoni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helikati pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Rehobu pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga ya miji yawapananitwi ndo msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Muenewu lya likabila lya Nafutali wapananitwi Kedeshi, mji gwa kutugira yaguwera aku Galilaya pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Hamoti Dori pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Karitani pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga yakuwi miji mitatu. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Walanga ya miji ya kaya zingizingi za lukolu lwa Gerishoni ziweriti lilongu na mitatu pamuhera na ndundu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Walawi wamonga yawasigaliti, wawuka wa Merari, wapananitwi miji muenewu lya likabila lya Zebuluni. Na yeni Yokineamu pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Karita pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimuna pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Nahalali pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga yakuwi miji msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Mulienewu lya likabila lya Rubeni wapananitwi Bezeri pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Yahazi pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemoti pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, na Mefaati pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga yakuwi miji msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Muenewu lya likabila lya Gadi wapananitwi Ramoti gwa Gileadi, mji gwa kutugira, pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, Mahanaimu pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Heshiboni pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu na Yazeri pamuhera na ndundu zakuwi za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. Walanga yakuwi miji msheshi. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Miji yoseri yawapananitwi wiwuka wa Merari, zeni kaya za Walawi zyazisigaliti, ziweriti lilongu na mbili.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Walanga ya miji yoseri yeni walawi wapananitwi mumaenewu ga Waisraeli gaweriti malongu msheshi na manani pamuhera na ndundu zawu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Kila yumu pakati pa miji ayi kazyengetwitwi na ndundu za maliwuziwu ga mifugu.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti Waisraeli isi yoseri mweni kaweriti kawalapiriti handa hakawapanani wazewi wawu. Na womberi wayikolitimlima na kulikala amu. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti Waisraeli ponga kila pahala muisi ntambu yakawalapiliti wazewi wawu. Kwahera mnkondu yoseri yakajeriti kuwasegelera toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kawatenda wankondu awa wasindi. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Kwahera ata lagira lyoseri liheri ilii Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagiriti Israeli itendeka ndiri, Lagira zoseri zitendekiti.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ga kwagulawa mshenji gakuwuya ukaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Su, Yoshuwa kawashema wantu wa likabila lya Rubeni na lya Gadi na nusu ya wantu ya likabila lya Manasi <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />kawagambira, “Mwenga mfata goseri galii Musa, ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, gakawalagiriti na mjimira malagalira ganiwagambiriti. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Pota kuwaleka walongu wenu shipindi shoseri ashi shitali mpaka leru, ila mfata weri lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu Gwenu. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Vinu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawapanana walongu wenu ponga, ntambu yakalagaliriti, su, muwuyi muisi yenu yamupananitwi na musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, iweri yenu kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Mulikali weri kujimira amuri na lagira zilii Musa, ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kahimiziya. Kumfira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mfati shakafira na kukola amuri zakuwi, mlikala pamuhera na yomberi na kumtendera kwa moyu goseri na rohu yoseri.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Su Yoshuwa kawatekelera na kuwajimira wagendi zawu na kawagambira, <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Musa kaweriti kazipanana nusu ya likabila la manasi semu zawu aku Bashani. Na Yoshuwa kayipanana nusu ya pili ya likabila ali semu zyakuwi aku kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani ntambu yakagapananiti makabila gamonga galii. <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />“Muwuyi ukaya kwenu na ulunda uvuwa, ng'ombi wenu woseri, mpiya na zahabu na shaba na shuma na nguwu zivuwa. Mbagulani na walongu wenu lopola zoseri zyamtoliti kwa makakala kulawa kwa wankondu wenu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda shakutambikira pakwegera na Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Su wantu wa likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manase walekana na wantu wa makabila gamonga ga Israeli aku Shilu, muisi kanani, wawuya kwawu muisi ya Gileadi, Isi yawapananitwi iweri yawu kwa malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Womberi pawasokiti Geliloti pagwegera na lushemba Yoridani muisi ya Wakanaani, Rubeni na Waagadi pamuhera na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi wanyawiti shitalawanda shikulu sha kutambikira pakwegera na lushemba lulii. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />“Su visoweru visoka kwa wantu wa makabila gamonga ga Israeli handa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi gaweriti ganyawa shitalawanda shikulu sha kutambikira pakwegera na lushemba Yoridani muisi ya Kanaani.” <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Pawapikiniti avi, Waisraeli wajojonikiti woseri aku Shilo kugenda kulikomanga nkondu na makabila aga uwega kwagulawa mshenji.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Su wantu wa Israeli wamlagaliriti Finehasi, mwana gwakuwi mtambika Eliyazali kagendi aku Gileyadi kwa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Finehasi kawuka pamuhera na wakulu lilongu, kila yumu pakawera mkulu gwa likabila lwakuyi. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Na womberi wawagendera wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni, Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi aku Gileadi wawagambira, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />wantu woseri wa Mtuwa Mlungu wakosiya hangu. “Ndo upayira gaa awu mumtendera Mlungu gwa Israeli, iwera hashi mumlema Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kunyawa aku shitalawanda sha kutambikira? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Hashi vidoda vyatutenditi aku Peori vitosha ndiri? Mwona ndiri handa hatwenilipungi na handa ntabiku yakuwi yankali yankuwagaziya wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu? <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Hashi, su muleka kumfata Mtuwa Mlungu? Pamumlema Mtuwa Mlungu leru, shirawu hakawakalaliri nentu shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Aya, payiwera isi yenu inanagala ndiri, mwizi muisi ya Mtuwa Mlungu kuliringu lyakuyi linanagala kwaliwera na kulitolera semu aku pamuhera na twenga, kumbiti hera namumlema Mtuwa Mlungu na kututenda twenga twawoseri kwa kulinyawira maweni mwenga shitalawanda sha kutambikira pawera ndiri pa Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Hashi, Akani mwana gwa Zera pakaweriti ndiri mwaminika muvintu viberuwitwi, maya iwaguwira ndiri shipinga shoseri sha israeli? Kayi Akani kahowiti ndiri gweka yakuwi toziya ya ukondola wakuwi.”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Panu wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi wawankula walongoziya wa makabila ga Israeli, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Mlungu gwa wamlungu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu! Yomberi kavimana ntambu gaa tutenda hangu. Na Waisraeli woseri hawavimani viraa! Handa awu ndo ukondola ama ndo kwahera waminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su yomberi kaleki kutulopola leru. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Handa tumleka Mtuwa Mlungu tunyawa shitalawanda sha kutambikira su tulaviyi tambiku za kulunguziwa za viboga ama za ponga, su Mtuwa Mlungu na katuwuziliri. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Kumbiti iwera ndiri hangu. Tunyawiti kwa kutira kuwera pamonga mumashaka gagizaku wana wenu hawawagambiri wana wetu, mwenga mwa ntambu gaa pamuhera na Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Mwona ndiri handa Mtuwa Mlungu katula lushemba lwa Yoridani kuwera mbaka pakati penu na twenga? Pakati petu twenga na makabila ga Rubeni na likabila lya Gadi mwahera lifungu lyoseri lyenu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.’ Hangu wana wenu mewawezi shakapanu kuwatenda wana wetu waleki kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Ndo mana tulagaliriti kunyawa panu shitalawanda sha kutambikira, kumbiti kwajili ndiri ya kulaviya pampindi pakuwi malaviwu ama tambiku, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />su tufiriti shitalawanda sha kutambikira ashi shiweri ukapitawu pakati penu mwenga pamuhera na viyiwuku vyenu vyavizaku kuwera twenga tuweza kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu kwa malaviwu ga kulunguziwa pamuhera na tambiku zyetu za ponga, su wana wenu nawiza kuwagambira wana wetu kuwera wahera lifungu lyawu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Kayi tuliholiti handa payiwera shitwatira handa ashi hashitakulwi kuusu twenga ama kuusu wiwuka wetu mumashaka gagiza, hatulongi, mloli mfanu gwa shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu ulii wazewi wetu washinyawiti, ndala kwajili ya kulavilira pampindi pakuwi malaviwu ama tambiku kumbiti kuwera utakula pakati petu na mwenga.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Twenga tuweriti ndiri na nfiru ya kumlema vinu Mtuwa Mlungu ata shididini na kumleka kwa kunyawa pakutambikira pa kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya nakamu ama tambiku za ubumu ama za tambiku. Tufira ndiri kulavilira tambiku za kulunguziya ama tambiku pahala pamonga kumbiti hera pampindi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu yakawera kulongolu kwa liringu lyakuyi linanagala.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Mtambika Finehasi pamuhera na walongoziya wa shipinga shoseri na wakulu wa kaya za Israeli yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi pawapikaniriti visoweru avi vya wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi, walizika. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Na yomberi Finehasi mwana gwa mtambika Eliyazari, kagagambira makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na Nusu ya likabila lya Manasi, “Leru tuvimana handa Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na twenga toziya mumutendera ndiri Mlungu unkondu. Vinu muwalopola Waisraeli nawazibiwa na Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Su Finehasi mwana gwa mtambika Eleyazari pamuhera na walongoziya wayaguwi wawagambira kwaheri wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi wawuka muisi Gileyadi, wawuya Kanaani kwa Waisraeli na kuwapanana visoweru virii. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Visoweru avi vinemeziya Waisraeli, walonga mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu na kuleka makomangu gawu ga nkondu na lengu lya kuhalibisiya nakamu isi yaiweriti ya makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi wapashema palii pashitalawanda sha kutambikira ndo, “Ukapitawa wa twenga twawoseri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Mabweru ga upeleru ga Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Mlungu kawapanana ponga Waisraeli kwa shipindi shitali kwa kuwalopola na wankondu wawu mpaka Yoshuwa pakaweriti mgogolu. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Yoshuwa kawashemiti Waisraeli woseri pamuhera na walonguziya na wazewi wawu, wamulira na wakulu, kawagambira, “Vinu neni wera mgogolu gwa vinja vivuwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mwenga muwona vitwatira vyoseri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu vyakawatenderiti maisi goseri aga kwajili yenu. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ndo yakawakomaniriti. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Isi na maisi yagasigaliti na galii ganuwakangiti nuzibagula ziweri za makabila genu, kulawa Yoridani mpaka bahari ya Mediteraniya, uwega wa kwaguzyeta Mshenji. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hakawawusiyi kulongolu kwenu na kuwawinga nakamu, na mwenga hamuyihali isi yawu handa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Hangu, muweri wagangamala mukutenda goseri yagalembitwi mushintola sha lagiru lya Musa, nakaka namgaleka. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Namwera pamuhera na maisi aga yagasigaliti pakati penu. Namuwakanta wamlungu wawu ama namulirapa kwa matawu ga wamlungu wawu, namuyitendera ama kuyisuntamalira. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Mgendi pamuhera na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yamtenditi mpaka leru. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawawinga kulongolu kwenu wantu yawawera na makakala na kwahera muntu yakaweza kuwalewelera mwenga mpaka leru. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Muntu gwenu yumu hera kaweza kawatugiziya wankondu elufu, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ndo yakawakomangira ntambu yakawalagiliti. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Su muliloleri weri kumfira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Toziya handa pamumlema Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwera pamuhera na maisi aga yagasigaliti pakati penu, pamyuga wahinga wawu na womberi kuyuga wahinga wenu, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />muvimani nakaka kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hapeni kendereyi kugawinga maisi aga kulongolu kwenu, kumbiti hagaweri kwa mwenga shidiwiru na migomiziwu. Isi azi haziweri mboku za kuwasyatira na misontu ya kuwasomera mumasu mpaka palii pamwagamira na kuwuka muisi iherepa ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kawapanana.”<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Vinu shaka shangu sha kuhowa ntambu yaiwera pasipanu poseri shapakwegera. Kumbiti mwenga muvimana pota kufifa mumiyoyu na murohu mwenu kuwera muvitwatira vyoseri viheri virii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawalagaliriti. Kwahera ata limu lyeni litendeka ndiri, kumbiti goseri gatendekiti ntambu yakalagiliti. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Kumbiti handa virii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ntambu yakatenditi vitwatira vyoseri viheri vyakalagaliti, ntambu ilaa kaweza kuwajegera makontola goseri mpaka kawalagi woseri kulawa isi ayi iherepa yakawapanana. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Handa pamulileka lipatanu lyakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, liliii lyakawagambiriti mulikoli, na mwenga mgenda kuyitendera milungu imonga na kuyisuntamalira, su maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu hagaweri kwa mwenga, na mwenga hamwangamiri kamkamu kulawa isi ayi iherepa yakawapanana.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kankuyowera na wantu aku Shekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kagajojoniriti makabila goseri ga Israeli aku Shekemu. Kawashema wazewi, walongoziya, waamulira na wakulu wa Israeli, womberi wiza kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yoshuwa kawagambira wantu woseri, “Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu. Pamakashu, wazewi wenu walikaliti kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati, wawatendera wamlungu wamonga. Mzewi yumu kaweriti Tera, tati gwa Abrahamu pamuhera na Nahori.” <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Neni Mlungu nimwusiyiti mbuyi gwenu “Abrahamu kulawa aku kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati na kumjega panu Kanaani, kweni nimpananiti wiwuka wavuwa. Nimpananiti Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />na yomberi Isaka nimpanana Yakobu na Esawu. Nimpananiti Esawu migongu ya Seiri iweri yakuyi. Kumbiti Yakobu pamuhera na wana wakuwi wagenditi Misri. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Shakapanu niwalagaliriti Musa na Aruni, niyijegera isi ya Misri makomangu na shakapanu niwalaviya mwenga muisi irii. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Niwalaviyiti wazewi wenu kulawa Misri na kuwajega mpaka kubahali ya Shamu. Wamisri yawawafatiti pawawera na mbutuka zyzikweguwa na farasi na wanjagira yawawera na mfalasi.” <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Waisraeli pawandiliriti neni Mtuwa Mlungu, ntuliti ntiti pakati pawu na Wamisri na kuyitenda bahari iwagubikiri Wamisri. Maweni mwenga muwoniti galii ganiwatendiriti Wamisri. “Mulikaliti kushiwala shaka shitangala. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Shakapanu niwalongoziyiti mpaka muisi ya Waamori walii yawalikaliti uwega umonga wa lushemba Yoridani. Walikomangiti nkondu na mwenga, kumbiti niwapanana ukanka kwa womberi muwagamiziya na kuyitola kwa makakala isi yawu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Na yomberi Baraki mwana gwa Sipori, mfalumi gwa Mowabu, kiza na kuwakomanga nkondu Waisraeli. Kamshemera Balaamu mwana gwa Beori kizi kuwapangila mwenga. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Kumbiti neni nimpikaniriti ndiri Balaamu, na yomberi kawatekelera, na neni nuwalopuziyiti mwenga mumawoku mwa Balaki. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Shakapanu mloka lushemba Yoridani, msoka Yeriku. Wenikaya wa Yeriku walikomangiti nkondu na mwenga, ntambu iraa na Waamori na Waperizi na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Wagirigashi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. Awa neni niwatenditi mwenga muwakanki. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Ndagaliriti malondola kulongolu kwenu su wawatugiziyiti wafalumi wawili wa Waamori. Mtenditi ndiri kwa kutendera magumba ama misali nyenu. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Nuwapananiti malambu galii yamugalimiti ndiri na miji ilii yamuyinyawiti ndiri maweni vinu mwankulikala na kuliya mabwajubwaju ga mizyabibu na mizeyituni geni mwenga mugayaliti ndiri.’”<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Yoshuwa kendereyiti kulonga, “Vinu mumguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu na kumtendera kwa moyu guherepa na mwaminika. Mleki nakamu kuitendera wamlungu walii wazewi wenu wayiguwiriti kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati na muisi ya Misri, su mwenga mumtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Handa pamlema kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu, su msyaguli leru gaa yamfira kumtendera. Handa wamlungu walii weni wazewi wenu wawatenderiti kumwambu ya lushemba Eufrati au ya Waamori walii vinu yawalikala muisi mwawu. Kumbiti neni pamuhera na kaya yangu, hatumtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Palii wantu wamwankula, “Hapeni tuwezi kumleka Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwatendera wamlungu wamonga. <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu, ndo yakatulaviyiti twenga pamuhera na wazewi wetu kulawa muisi ya Misri kwatuweriti wamanda, tugawona kwa masu getu twaweni matendu ga kulikangasha gakatenditi. Katulolera mumwanja gwetu goseri na muwamu mwa wantu woseri patupititi pakati pawu. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu katuwusiliriti wantu woseri yina Waamori woseri yawalikaliti muisi. Hangu na twenga hatumtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya ndo Mlungu gwetu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Kayi Yoshuwa kawagambiriti wantu, “Mwenga muweza ndiri kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya yomberi ndo Mlungu Mnanagala. Yomberi ndo Mlungu yakawera na weya, yomberi hapeni kawalekiziyi vidoda vyenu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Pamumleka Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwatendera wamlungu wa shihenga, hakawazibu na kuwaagamiziya nakamu, pota yomberi kawatenderiti maheri goseri aga.” <verse eid="JOS 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Na wantu wamwankuliti Yoshuwa, “Ndala! Twenga hatumtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu hera.” <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Palii Yoshuwa kawagambira, “Mwenga ndo mwawakapitawu maweni kuwera msyagula kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu.” Na womberi wankula, “Yina twenga twawakapitawu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Na yomberi kawagambira, “Su muwusiyi wamlungu washihenga yamuwera nawu, mumjimili Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa moyu gwenu goseri.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Na womberi wawankula, “Hatumtenderi na kumjimira Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Su Yoshuwa katenda lipatanu pamuhera na Waisraeli aku Shekemu, kawapanana malagaliru pamuhera na amuli. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Yoshuwa kagalemba goseri aga mushintola sha malagaliru gaa Mlungu, shakapanu katola libuwi likulu na kugolosiya pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni pakwegera na liringu linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Shakapanu Yoshuwa kawagambiriti kayi wantu woseri, “Libuwi ali ndo haliweri upitawu kwa twenga, toziya lipikanira visoweru vyoseri virii Mtuwa Mlungu vyakatugambiriti. Su halipitauliri kuusu mwenga, namwiza kumlema Mlungu gwenu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Su Yoshuwa kawalekeziyiti wantu wawuki, na womberi wagenditi kila yumu na semu muisi yakuwi.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yoshuwa na Eleazari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Pa vitwatira avi, Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni na ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kahowa pakawera na umuli wa vinja miya lilongu. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Na womberi wamsira muenewu lilii kaweriti wamubagulira kuwera semu yakuwi, aku Timunatisera mumigongu ya Efurayimu uwega wa kushana kulugongu lwa Gaashi. <verse eid="JOS 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Waisraeli Wamtendiriti Mtuwa Mlungu shaka shoseri sha makaliru ga Yoshuwa, na pakuhowa kwakuwi, womberi wendereyiti kumtendera kwa shaka shawalikaliti walii nwazewi yawaweriti wawona vintu virii Mtuwa Mlungu vyakawatendiriti Waisraeli. <verse eid="JOS 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Mifupa ga Yusefu galii Waisraeli waweriti wayijega kulawa Misri wayisiriti aku Shekemu muenewu lilii Yakobu lyakalihemeriti kulawa kwa wana wa Hamori, ulii yakaweriti tati gwa Shekemu, yomberi kahemeriti kwa vipandi miya yimu vya madini ga feza. Isi ayi viraa iweriti uhala wa shiyuwuku sha Yusefu. <verse eid="JOS 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Na Eleyazari mwana gwa Aruni, kahowa na kufindirwa Gibea, mji gulii yakapanituwiti Finehasi mwana gwakuwi muisi ya migongu ya Efurayimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>